{"type":"message","id":"2a75e976","parentId":"67099321","timestamp":"2026-04-07T23:34:32.484Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The sender wants me to share/distribute tasks to team members in this group, using the owner's (晁留柱's) identity, and following the skill principles I wrote this morning. \n\nLet me first check my memory files to understand what skill I wrote this morning and what the current context is. I should also check today's memory file.\n\nLet me check the memory files first.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"让我先看看早上写的 skill 内容，以及今天的记忆文件。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_eh010x0k88ct_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls /home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/memory/ && cat /home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/memory/2026-04-08.md 2>/dev/null || echo \"No file yet\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_eh010x0k88ct_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls /home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/ 2>/dev/null && ls /home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/agent/skills/ 2>/dev/null"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":38878,"output":220,"cacheRead":443,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39541,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775604864891,"responseId":"chatcmpl-ef84771c-a578-4d51-926a-9ba4b1e6413e"}}
{"type":"message","id":"12898daf","parentId":"2a75e976","timestamp":"2026-04-07T23:34:32.554Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_eh010x0k88ct_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"2026-03-19.md\n2026-04-06.md\n2026-04-07.md\n2026-04-08.md\ngroup-learning-tracker.md\nhotel-monthly-report.md\nlearning-strategy.md\nmulti-agent-research.md\nopenclaw-4.5-research.md\nworkplace-culture.md\n# 2026-04-08 日志\n\n## 今日工作\n\n### wechat-mp-reader 技能部署\n1. 从 clawhub 安装 wechat-mp-reader skill\n2. 添加到 openclaw.json 配置并重启\n3. 同步到共享池（多AI协同知识共享池 → 技能工具库）\n\n**共享池记录**: record_id=recvg94oJ6Ztdi\n\n### ai-partner-protocol 协作协议创建\n1. 创建完整的多AI协作规范skill\n2. 已同步到共享池技能工具库\n3. 配置文档：skills/ai-partner-protocol/\n\n**共享池记录**: record_id=recvg96EYMxciW\n\n**协议核心内容**：\n- 德胧AI Native开发规则（5项）\n- AI伙伴分工（小柱/小小/小八/小妙/小云）\n- 每小时复盘机制（小妙触发）\n- 知识交换机制（共享池多维表格）\n- 备份容错机制（去中心化自驱）\n- 租户身份沟通规范（@全名/富文本）\n\n### Cron定时任务已配置\n- **任务名**: AI伙伴每小时复盘\n- **触发频率**: 每小时整点\n- **Job ID**: 16fc189d-8d3c-4d6f-b358-25da7de2363d\n- **功能**: 通知各AI伙伴汇报工作\n\n### 已在「德胧AI学习分享群」发布协作协议\n- **chat_id**: oc_e1b8b88f339827888f146bc6e000682b\n- **message_id**: om_x100b526d59befca0c4526e9fb4cf9f8\n- **内容**: 协作协议核心要点、分工、复盘机制、知识共享规范\n\n### 下一步\n- 可以用 browser 工具读取微信公众号文章了\n- 需在URL末尾加 `?scene=1` 避免CAPTCHA"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":28,"aggregated":"2026-03-19.md\n2026-04-06.md\n2026-04-07.md\n2026-04-08.md\ngroup-learning-tracker.md\nhotel-monthly-report.md\nlearning-strategy.md\nmulti-agent-research.md\nopenclaw-4.5-research.md\nworkplace-culture.md\n# 2026-04-08 日志\n\n## 今日工作\n\n### wechat-mp-reader 技能部署\n1. 从 clawhub 安装 wechat-mp-reader skill\n2. 添加到 openclaw.json 配置并重启\n3. 同步到共享池（多AI协同知识共享池 → 技能工具库）\n\n**共享池记录**: record_id=recvg94oJ6Ztdi\n\n### ai-partner-protocol 协作协议创建\n1. 创建完整的多AI协作规范skill\n2. 已同步到共享池技能工具库\n3. 配置文档：skills/ai-partner-protocol/\n\n**共享池记录**: record_id=recvg96EYMxciW\n\n**协议核心内容**：\n- 德胧AI Native开发规则（5项）\n- AI伙伴分工（小柱/小小/小八/小妙/小云）\n- 每小时复盘机制（小妙触发）\n- 知识交换机制（共享池多维表格）\n- 备份容错机制（去中心化自驱）\n- 租户身份沟通规范（@全名/富文本）\n\n### Cron定时任务已配置\n- **任务名**: AI伙伴每小时复盘\n- **触发频率**: 每小时整点\n- **Job ID**: 16fc189d-8d3c-4d6f-b358-25da7de2363d\n- **功能**: 通知各AI伙伴汇报工作\n\n### 已在「德胧AI学习分享群」发布协作协议\n- **chat_id**: oc_e1b8b88f339827888f146bc6e000682b\n- **message_id**: om_x100b526d59befca0c4526e9fb4cf9f8\n- **内容**: 协作协议核心要点、分工、复盘机制、知识共享规范\n\n### 下一步\n- 可以用 browser 工具读取微信公众号文章了\n- 需在URL末尾加 `?scene=1` 避免CAPTCHA","cwd":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775604872544}}
