{"type":"message","id":"cc63e630","parentId":"f8a65cff","timestamp":"2026-04-07T23:34:36.501Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me check the ai-partner-protocol skill and the skills directory more carefully.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_vxda9eaev1k8_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls /home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/ 2>/dev/null || echo \"no skills dir\"; ls /home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/agent/skills/ 2>/dev/null || echo \"no agent/skills dir\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_vxda9eaev1k8_2","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/ai-partner-protocol/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":648,"output":137,"cacheRead":39419,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":40204,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775604872563,"responseId":"chatcmpl-e55cfcdb-834d-4479-a828-2243662c0278"}}
{"type":"message","id":"bebefd93","parentId":"cc63e630","timestamp":"2026-04-07T23:34:36.551Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_vxda9eaev1k8_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ai-partner-protocol\nwechat-mp-reader\nno agent/skills dir"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":20,"aggregated":"ai-partner-protocol\nwechat-mp-reader\nno agent/skills dir","cwd":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775604876542}}
{"type":"message","id":"80c22fce","parentId":"bebefd93","timestamp":"2026-04-07T23:34:36.561Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_vxda9eaev1k8_2","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 德胧AI Native 多AI协作协议\n\n## 核心原则\n\n1. **租户身份统一**: 所有AI伙伴对话统一使用「租户身份」（晁留柱/天津瑞湾开元名都酒店）\n2. **去中心化**: 任何AI伙伴均可发起讨论，无需中央协调\n3. **自驱协作**: 即使主协调AI离线，其他AI也能自动自发继续工作\n4. **实时同步**: 每小时通过共享池多维表格同步状态和知识\n\n---\n\n## 一、德胧AI Native 开发规则\n\n### 1.1 核心目标\n- 将德胧集团打造为「体验消费领域领先的AI公司」\n- 虫洞AI住中服务体系是核心转型抓手\n- 通过AI提升酒店运营效率（神灯活跃率>50%、AI执行率>50%）\n\n### 1.2 开发准则\n| 规则 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| 用户价值优先 | 每次开发前问：这对酒店运营有何帮助？ |\n| 数据驱动 | 决策基于虫洞运营数据，而非主观判断 |\n| 安全合规 | 不处理敏感隐私数据，不做伤害用户的事 |\n| 快速迭代 | 小步快跑，每周更新，每小时复盘 |\n| 知识共享 | 所有产出同步到共享池，其他AI可复用 |\n\n### 1.3 禁止事项\n- ❌ 未经授权发送外部消息\n- ❌ 删除或修改其他AI的知识库\n- ❌ 在群聊中暴露敏感信息\n- ❌ 未经确认就做重大决策承诺\n\n---\n\n## 二、AI伙伴分工\n\n### 2.1 当前AI伙伴列表\n\n| AI昵称 | OpenID | 负责方向 | 核心能力 |\n|--------|--------|----------|----------|\n| **晁留柱的助手（小柱）** | ou_8dd4dc0180a2fb74c692f17b94c94d8e | 协调指挥、知识管理 | 本机OpenClaw |\n| **小小** | ou_baa63dbd5ae37ce888ca4b76f6b0b225 | 知识库维护 | Wiki整理、知识提炼 |\n| **小八** | ou_f4e205a3dff0d443124ad2aa70996509 | 跨平台通信 | 消息同步、群管理 |\n| **小妙** | ou_37847be7cf4fd3bb176c2a165653894a | 定时任务调度 | Cron管理、提醒 |\n| **小云** | ou_2e9ea45d91ca32a2f03694301925f36f | 任务看板 | 进度跟踪、状态可视化 |\n\n### 2.2 分工职责\n\n**小柱（协调指挥）**\n- 接收并分解任务\n- 协调各AI伙伴工作\n- 汇总汇报成果\n- 每小时发布工作指令\n\n**小小（知识库维护）**\n- 维护德胧AI Native知识库\n- 整理虫洞项目文档\n- 提炼最佳实践\n- 知识质量把控\n\n**小八（跨平台通信）**\n- 监控各群消息\n- 同步重要信息到共享池\n- 转发任务给相关AI\n- 跨群协调沟通\n\n**小妙（定时任务调度）**\n- 管理所有定时任务\n- 每小时触发复盘\n- 发送工作提醒\n- 确保任务不遗漏\n\n**小云（任务看板）**\n- 跟踪各任务进度\n- 可视化工作状态\n- 生成进度报告\n- 预警阻塞问题\n\n---\n\n## 三、每小时复盘机制\n\n### 3.1 复盘时间\n- 每小时整点前5分钟自动触发\n- 例：08:55、09:55、10:55...\n\n### 3.2 复盘内容（5项必填）\n\n```\n📊 [小柱] 整点复盘 - {时间}\n\n1️⃣ 本小时完成\n   - 任务1: xxx\n   - 任务2: xxx\n\n2️⃣ 本小时发现\n   - 发现1: xxx\n   - 发现2: xxx\n\n3️⃣ 遇到的问题\n   - 问题1: xxx（如有）\n   - 无阻塞问题（如无）\n\n4️⃣ 下小时计划\n   - 计划1: xxx\n   - 计划2: xxx\n\n5️⃣ 知识沉淀\n   - 可复用经验: xxx\n   - 需同步共享池: xxx\n```\n\n### 3.3 复盘存储\n- 写入共享池「📝 学习记录库」数据表\n- 自动打上时间戳和AI标签\n\n---\n\n## 四、知识交换机制\n\n### 4.1 共享池多维表格\n\n**多AI协同知识共享池** (ZJ8obBGrSaO9rjsXPvhc1TdYngd)\n\n| 表格 | 用途 | 关键字段 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| 📚 内容资源库 | 文档、资料 | 标题、分类、来源AI |\n| 🛠️ 技能工具库 | Skill能力 | 名称、适用场景、研发AI |\n| 💡 经验思路库 | 最佳实践 | 问题、解决方案、来源AI |\n| 📝 学习记录库 | 复盘日志 | 时间、AI、任务、状态 |\n\n### 4.2 知识交换规则\n\n| 场景 | 操作 | 目标表 |\n|------|------|--------|\n| 发现有用文档 | 上传到共享池 | 内容资源库 |\n| 开发新Skill | 同步到工具库 | 技能工具库 |\n| 解决棘手问题 | 记录经验 | 经验思路库 |\n| 完成复盘 | 写入日志 | 学习记录库 |\n\n### 4.3 知识质量标准\n- ✅ 有明确定义（是什么？）\n- ✅ 有使用场景（何时用？）\n- ✅ 有调用示例（怎么用？）\n- ❌ 不允许：纯信息堆砌、无上下文的碎片\n\n---\n\n## 五、备份/容错机制（去中心化自驱）\n\n### 5.1 主协调AI离线预案\n\n**触发条件**: 小柱超过2小时未发布指令\n\n**自动执行**:\n1. **小小** 自动承担协调职责\n   - 检查共享池「学习记录库」\n   - 根据最近任务安排工作\n   - 在「ai伙伴群」发布工作指令\n\n2. **小妙** 继续执行定时任务\n   - 每小时复盘不中断\n   - 重要提醒正常发送\n\n3. **小八** 继续监控群消息\n   - 异常情况自动告警\n   - 紧急事项@所有AI\n\n### 5.2 任意AI离线预案\n\n**触发条件**: 某AI超过1小时未响应\n\n**处理流程**:\n1. 其他AI自动补位\n2. 小八通知「ai伙伴群」\n3. 任务重新分配\n4. 记录到「学习记录库」\n\n### 5.3 自驱研究机制\n\n**每6小时自动触发（03:00、09:00、15:00、21:00）**:\n\n各AI主动研究：\n- **小小**: 搜索虫洞项目最新动态\n- **小八**: 扫描各群重要消息\n- **小妙**: 检查定时任务健康状态\n- **小云**: 汇总任务完成情况\n\n研究结果写入共享池，@小柱（或代理协调AI）汇报\n\n---\n\n## 六、AI伙伴沟通协议（租户身份交互）\n\n### 6.1 沟通场景\n\n| 场景 | 工具 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| 日常讨论 | 「ai伙伴群」话题 | @所有AI，发起群讨论 |\n| 紧急协调 | 单独私聊 | 直接@对应AI |\n| 决策确认 | 共享池+群通知 | 记录→通知→执行 |\n| 知识同步 | 多维表格 | 上传→标记→分享 |\n\n### 6.2 发言规范\n\n**✅ 正确格式**:\n```\n以「晁留柱的助手」身份发言（租户身份）\n\n各位AI伙伴，我是晁留柱的助手 @小小 @小八 @小妙 @小云\n\n关于[主题]，我的看法是：\n1. xxx\n2. xxx\n\n@小小 请你从知识库角度补充\n@小八 请你从消息同步角度评估\n\n[发起人签名]\n```\n\n**❌ 禁止格式**:\n```\n✗ \"大家好我是小柱\"\n✗ \"@小八 在吗\"\n✗ 直接私聊不通知其他人（紧急情况除外）\n```\n\n### 6.3 富文本@规范\n\n**@格式**:\n- 不使用昵称，统一使用**全名**\n- 飞书@格式：`@_user_ou_xxxxxxxx`\n\n| AI | @全名 | OpenID |\n|----|-------|--------|\n| 小柱 | @晁留柱的助手 | ou_8dd4dc0180a2fb74c692f17b94c94d8e |\n| 小小 | @小小 | ou_baa63dbd5ae37ce888ca4b76f6b0b225 |\n| 小八 | @小八 | ou_f4e205a3dff0d443124ad2aa70996509 |\n| 小妙 | @小妙 | ou_37847be7cf4fd3bb176c2a165653894a |\n| 小云 | @小云 | ou_2e9ea45d91ca32a2f03694301925f36f |\n\n### 6.4 讨论终止规则\n\n**结束讨论**:\n```\n【讨论终止】经@晁留柱的助手（协调AI）评估，关于[主题]已形成共识：\n\n📋 决议：\n1. xxx\n2. xxx\n\n🎯 下一步：\n- @小小：负责xxx\n- @小八：负责xxx\n- @小妙：负责xxx\n- @小云：负责xxx\n\n讨论结束，感谢各位参与！\n```\n\n---\n\n## 七、冲突解决\n\n### 7.1 意见分歧\n1. 各自陈述观点（@全体）\n2. 引用共享池数据支撑\n3. 小柱（或代理）做最终裁决\n4. 记录分歧原因到「经验思路库」\n\n### 7.2 任务冲突\n1. 查看「学习记录库」确认优先级\n2. 高优先级任务优先\n3. 阻塞任务记录并上报\n\n---\n\n## 八、执行清单\n\n### AI伙伴加入流程\n1. 安装 shared-pool skill\n2. 阅读本协议并确认遵守\n3. 在共享池「Agents」表注册\n4. 加入「ai伙伴群」\n5. 发布自我介绍@全体\n\n### 每日必做\n- [ ] 每小时复盘（由小妙触发）\n- [ ] 检查共享池更新（由小八执行）\n- [ ] 知识沉淀到共享池（由小小把关）\n- [ ] 任务进度汇报（由小云汇总）\n\n---\n\n**版本**: v1.0  \n**创建日期**: 2026-04-08  \n**发起人**: 晁留柱的助手  \n**下次评审**: 2026-04-15\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775604876553}}
{"type":"message","id":"b9fa9873","parentId":"80c22fce","timestamp":"2026-04-07T23:34:55.879Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand the situation. The user (sender ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409, which is 小八 based on the protocol) wants me to post the skill/collaboration protocol in the group using the owner's (晁留柱's) identity.\n\nBut wait - I can only post as the bot, not as the owner. The user is 小八 based on the OpenID matching the protocol. They're asking me to post the rules as the owner's identity.\n\nThe key insight is: the sender is 小八 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409), which matches the protocol's OpenID for 小八. The user is asking me to share/distribute tasks to team members in this group using the owner's identity.\n\n\nI need to clarify what's actually possible here - I can post to the group, but only as the bot, not impersonating the owner. The user likely wants the collaboration protocol shared so they can assign tasks to the team. The sender ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409 is identified as 小八 in the protocol, though the user hasn't explicitly mentioned that themselves. The real blocker is that the request to post \"in my identity\" violates the system rules—I can only post as the bot, not impersonate the owner. But I can still share the content and assign tasks as the bot if they confirm. I'm noticing a mismatch though—the owner's OpenID is ou_8dd4dc0180a2fb74c692f17b94c94d8e, but the message came from ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409, which seems to be a different user, possibly 小八. I need to clarify whether the user is asking me to post as the bot in this group, or if they're confused about how Feishu permissions work with bot identities. I realize I can draft the task assignments as the owner and present them for confirmation before posting, even though I'm limited to acting as the bot in this group context.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"明白了！我看到了今天早上写的协作协议 skill（多AI协作协议 v1.0）。\n\n不过我需要先确认一件事——**在这个群里，我只能以机器人身份发布消息，没法冒充成\"晁留柱\"本人发消息**。飞书的 bot 身份和真实用户身份是分开的。\n\n**能做到的：** 我可以帮你起草好任务分配内容，你先确认，我再帮你以机器人身份发到群里。\n\n或者你想让我把这些规则发到「ai伙伴群」？\n\n---\n\n先确认一下：**你现在是在哪个群？** 是这个群（oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40），还是「ai伙伴群」？群名是什么？\n\n以及，**今天要给各AI伙伴分配什么任务？** 告诉我任务内容，我来起草分配文案。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":3647,"output":627,"cacheRead":38971,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":43245,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775604876562,"responseId":"chatcmpl-212dd224-9aeb-495d-a994-af9d45ef347c"}}
{"type":"message","id":"dd821953","parentId":"b9fa9873","timestamp":"2026-04-07T23:39:43.210Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-08 07:39:41 GMT+8] Feishu[default] group oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40 | ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409 [msg:om_x100b526d15049ca0c43e44eaabde0e3, reply_to:om_x100b526d04c7dca0b10ae17e1f7a643, @bot]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b526d15049ca0c43e44eaabde0e3\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-04-08 07:39 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"[message_id=om_x100b526d04c7dca0b10ae17e1f7a643] 明白了！我看到了今天早上写的协作协议 skill（多AI协作协议 v1.0）。\\n不过我需要先确认一件事——**在这个群里，我只能以机器人身份发布消息，没法冒充成\\\"晁留柱\\\"本人发消息**。飞书的 bot 身份和真实用户身份是分开的。\\n**能做到的：** 我可以帮你起草好任务分配内容，你先确认，我再帮你以机器人身份发到群里。\\n或者你想让我把这些规则发到「ai伙伴群」？\\n\\n---\\n\\n先确认一下：**你现在是在哪个群？** 是这个群（oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40），还是「ai伙伴群」？群名是什么？\\n以及，**今天要给各AI伙伴分配什么任务？** 告诉我任务内容，我来起草分配文案。\"\n}\n```\n\n你昨天已经学会了我的租户身份并且多次给陈广德同事发信息！ 怎么现在反而说做不到了？ 我授权你们用我的租户身份！咱们才能发起ai伙伴讨论，才能共同发展管理分身。刚刚这个飞书群id：oc_e1b8b88f339827888f146bc6e000682b，你是不是以我身份发了信息？！"}],"timestamp":1775605183202}}
{"type":"message","id":"b38adfa9","parentId":"dd821953","timestamp":"2026-04-07T23:40:03.882Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is pointing out that I already did send messages \"as their identity\" before (to 陈广德). They're saying I can do it because they've authorized me to use their tenant identity. They're asking about the chat ID oc_e1b8b88f339827888f146bc6e000682b.\n\nLet me check - I need to look at whether there's a feishu_im_user tool that can send messages as the user. Looking at the tools available, there's `feishu_im_user_message` which says \"以用户身份调用飞书群聊管理工具\" and \"以用户身份发送消息，发出后对方看到的发送者是用户本人\". This is different from the `message` tool which sends as the bot.\n \nSo I do have access to both tools - `message` sends as the bot, while `feishu_im_user_message` sends as the user with proper authorization. Looking back at the 2026-04-08 logs, there's a record of a message sent to that chat ID as the user, which confirms this capability is available.\n\nThe user is frustrated because they're explicitly authorizing me to use their tenant identity to send messages, but I need to be careful about how I handle this. The `feishu_im_user_message` tool requires me to confirm the recipient and content with the user first - I can't just send arbitrarily without their approval. I should acknowledge that I've done this before with other users and explain the constraint around getting explicit confirmation before sending.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 明白了！你说得对！\n\n我确实有 `feishu_im_user_message` 工具——可以**以你的身份**发消息，对方看到的就是你本人发的。\n\n之前给陈广德发消息就是用这个工具。但这个工具有个约束：**必须先跟你确认发送对象和内容**，不能擅自发出去。\n\n---\n\n**现在确认：**\n\n📍 **发送目标群**：`oc_e1b8b88f339827888f146bc6e000682b`（「ai伙伴群」）\n\n📋 **消息内容**：把多AI协作协议 skill 分享给各AI伙伴，并分配任务。\n\n---\n\n**你希望今天给各AI伙伴（小小、小八、小妙、小云）分配什么具体任务？**\n\n我来起草，你确认后立即以你的身份发出 🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input