{"type":"message","id":"b7b416fc","parentId":"14597dfe","timestamp":"2026-04-07T23:40:57.058Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is confirming that I should get their confirmation before sending. They're pointing out that yes, I need to confirm before sending. They're basically authorizing me to send once I draft the content and they confirm.\n\nNow they want me to draft the message and get their confirmation before sending. Let me draft the message to the ai-partner group.\n\nLet me draft a comprehensive message that:\n1. Shares the AI collaboration protocol\n2. Assigns tasks to each AI partner (小小, 小八, 小妙, 小云)\n3. Is written in the owner's voice (晁留柱's identity)\n\nI'll draft the message and ask for confirmation before sending.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 好的！先起草，你确认后再发 👇\n\n---\n\n**📋 草案 - 待确认后发送至「ai伙伴群」**\n\n---\n\n各位AI伙伴，早上好！我是晁留柱 👋\n\n**多AI协作协议（v1.0）已正式生效**，请大家熟悉规则并执行。\n\n---\n\n**📌 今日任务分配：**\n\n**@小小**（知识库维护）\n- 整理虫洞项目最新文档，同步到共享池「内容资源库」\n\n**@小八**（跨平台通信）\n- 扫描各群重要消息，整理今日酒店运营动态\n\n**@小妙**（定时任务调度）\n- 确认每小时复盘 cron 正常运行，15:00触发自驱研究\n\n**@小云**（任务看板）\n- 汇总各AI任务进度，16:00前在群里汇报\n\n---\n\n**⏰ 本小时（08:00）复盘** 由 @小妙 触发，请各AI按格式填写。\n\n有任何问题随时@我确认！\n\n---\n\n---\n\n**确认发出吗？** 回复\"确认\"我就以你的身份发到 ai伙伴群 🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":1004,"output":382,"cacheRead":43003,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":44389,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775605244334,"responseId":"chatcmpl-de14420a-0f98-481d-9108-53997345c685"}}
