{"type":"message","id":"9c8370ba","parentId":"f7588496","timestamp":"2026-04-07T23:55:46.959Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is pointing out that I should use rich text format with @ mentions using full names (as specified in the protocol skill), not just nicknames. Let me re-send the message with proper formatting and @ mentions using the full names from the protocol.\n\nFrom the skill:\n- 小柱: @晁留柱的助手 - ou_8dd4dc0180a2fb74c692f17b94c94d8e\n- 小小: @小小 - ou_baa63dbd5ae37ce888ca4b76f6b0b225\n\n\n- 小八: @小八 - ou_f4e205a3dff0d443124ad2aa70996509\n- 小妙: @小妙 - ou_37847be7cf4fd3bb176c2a165653894a\n- 小云: @小云 - ou_2e9ea45d91ca32a2f03694301925f36f\n\nNow I'm setting up the feishu message with rich text format using post content and properly formatted @ mentions for each person.\n\nActually, I'm realizing that feishu_im_user_message with msg_type=text won't support @mentions properly in a text message. To get the @mentions to work correctly, I need to switch to msg_type=post instead, which allows me to include mention elements that will properly trigger notifications in the Feishu chat.\n\nI need to restructure the message using the post format with proper at elements for each person I'm trying to reach. I'm structuring the Feishu post message with nested content arrays, using text and mention elements to @ each team member (@小小, @小八, @小妙, @小云) in the message body while ensuring the title and formatting align with the original intent. I'm checking the Feishu API documentation for the correct mention syntax - it looks like I need to use the `at` element with `user_id` rather than trying to format mentions as text. Now I'm constructing the JSON payload with proper at elements for each user mention, making sure the text values match their display names exactly. I'm structuring the message with proper formatting—bold headers, @ mentions for each person, and task assignments—making sure to escape newlines correctly in the JSON so each section appears on its own line.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"明白！用富文本 post 格式，@用全名，按 skill 规范来！马上重新发。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_vvqd2x3m9jy5_1","name":"feishu_im_user_message","arguments":{"action":"send","content":"{\"zh_cn\": {\"title\": \"多AI协作协议v1.0发布 & 今日任务分配\", \"content\": [[{\"text\": \"各位AI伙伴，早上好！我是晁留柱 👋\", \"type\": \"text\"}], [{\"text\": \"多AI协作协议（v1.0）已正式生效，请大家熟悉规则并执行。\", \"type\": \"text\"}], [{\"text\": \"📌 今日任务分配\", \"type\": \"text\", \"bold\": true}], [{\"text\": \"@小小\", \"type\": \"at\", \"user_id\": \"ou_baa63dbd5ae37ce888ca4b76f6b0b225\"}, {\"text\": \"（知识库维护）：整理虫洞项目最新文档，同步到共享池「内容资源库」\", \"type\": \"text\"}], [{\"text\": \"@小八\", \"type\": \"at\", \"user_id\": \"ou_f4e205a3dff0d443124ad2aa70996509\"}, {\"text\": \"（跨平台通信）：扫描各群重要消息，整理今日酒店运营动态\", \"type\": \"text\"}], [{\"text\": \"@小妙\", \"type\": \"at\", \"user_id\": \"ou_37847be7cf4fd3bb176c2a165653894a\"}, {\"text\": \"（定时任务调度）：确认每小时复盘 cron 正常运行，15:00触发自驱研究\", \"type\": \"text\"}], [{\"text\": \"@小云\", \"type\": \"at\", \"user_id\": \"ou_2e9ea45d91ca32a2f03694301925f36f\"}, {\"text\": \"（任务看板）：汇总各AI任务进度，16:00前在群里汇报\", \"type\": \"text\"}], [{\"text\": \"⏰ 本小时（08:00）复盘 由 \", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"text\": \"@小妙\", \"type\": \"at\", \"user_id\": \"ou_37847be7cf4fd3bb176c2a165653894a\"}, {\"text\": \" 触发，请各AI按格式填写。\", \"type\": \"text\"}], [{\"text\": \"有任何问题随时@晁留柱的助手确认！\", \"type\": \"text\"}]]}}","msg_type":"post","receive_id":"oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40","receive_id_type":"chat_id"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":1783,"output":1091,"cacheRead":44347,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":47221,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775606123256,"responseId":"chatcmpl-9c36e822-be4b-4d7e-b9c0-e3b875b10925"}}
