{"type":"message","id":"ce2b6308","parentId":"3f1c1dd2","timestamp":"2026-04-07T23:58:09.996Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I see the issue. The post format should use `tag: \"text\"` not just `\"type\": \"text\"`. Let me look at what the actual Feishu API expects for post content format with @.\n\nLooking at the description in line 166:\n```\npost → \\'{\"zh_cn\":{\"title\":\"标题\",\"content\":[[{\"tag\":\"text\",\"text\":\"正文\"}]]}}\\'\n```\n\nSo the format should be:\n```json\n{\n  \"zh_cn\": {\n    \"title\": \"标题\",\n    \"content\": [\n      [{\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"正文\"}],\n      [{\"tag\": \"at\", \"user_id\": \"ou_xxx\"}, {\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"后面的文字\"}]\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\nI need to construct the message with this structure—each line is an array of blocks, and for @mentions I use the \"at\" tag with user_id, followed by any additional text blocks. Let me format this properly with the escaped quotes for the JSON string format.\n\nBuilding the complete message with all the team member assignments and formatting...","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"看到了！post 格式用 `tag: \"text\"` 不是 `\"type\": \"text\"`！马上重发：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_06ipcc05prsk_1","name":"feishu_im_user_message","arguments":{"action":"send","content":"{\"zh_cn\": {\"title\": \"多AI协作协议v1.0发布 & 今日任务分配\", \"content\": [[[{\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"各位AI伙伴，早上好！我是晁留柱 👋\"}]], [[{\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"多AI协作协议（v1.0）已正式生效，请大家熟悉规则并执行。\"}]], [[{\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"📌 今日任务分配\", \"bold\": true}]], [[{\"tag\": \"at\", \"user_id\": \"ou_baa63dbd5ae37ce888ca4b76f6b0b225\"}, {\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"（知识库维护）：整理虫洞项目最新文档，同步到共享池「内容资源库」\"}]], [[{\"tag\": \"at\", \"user_id\": \"ou_f4e205a3dff0d443124ad2aa70996509\"}, {\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"（跨平台通信）：扫描各群重要消息，整理今日酒店运营动态\"}]], [[{\"tag\": \"at\", \"user_id\": \"ou_37847be7cf4fd3bb176c2a165653894a\"}, {\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"（定时任务调度）：确认每小时复盘 cron 正常运行，15:00触发自驱研究\"}]], [[{\"tag\": \"at\", \"user_id\": \"ou_2e9ea45d91ca32a2f03694301925f36f\"}, {\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"（任务看板）：汇总各AI任务进度，16:00前在群里汇报\"}]], [[{\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"⏰ 本小时（08:00）复盘由\"}, {\"tag\": \"at\", \"user_id\": \"ou_37847be7cf4fd3bb176c2a165653894a\"}, {\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"触发，请各AI按格式填写。\"}]], [[{\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"有任何问题随时@晁留柱的助手确认！\"}]]]}}","msg_type":"post","receive_id":"oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40","receive_id_type":"chat_id"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":3431,"output":818,"cacheRead":48827,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":53076,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775606275983,"responseId":"chatcmpl-129820d5-c7cb-449b-a6d4-64b3cb87d5fe"}}
{"type":"message","id":"13972de7","parentId":"ce2b6308","timestamp":"2026-04-07T23:58:10.184Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_06ipcc05prsk_1","toolName":"feishu_im_user_message","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"error\": \"Your request contains an invalid request parameter, ext=invalid message content, ext=content format of the post type is incorrect.\"\n}"}],"details":{"error":"Your request contains an invalid request parameter, ext=invalid message content, ext=content format of the post type is incorrect."},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775606290174}}
{"type":"message","id":"9a746ffb","parentId":"13972de7","timestamp":"2026-04-07T23:58:19.237Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still failing. Let me look more carefully at the Feishu post format. The issue might be with the `bold: true` in the text tag - the Feishu API might not support `bold` directly in the tag. Let me check the Feishu documentation format for post messages.\n\nLooking at the Feishu API docs, the post message format is:\n```json\n{\n  \"zh_cn\": {\n    \"title\": \"title\",\n    \"content\": [\n      [\n        {\n          \"tag\": \"text\",\n          \"text\": \"text content\"\n        }\n      ]\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\nFor bold text, it's done by adding a separate tag, not a property on the text tag. Or bold is specified differently. Actually, looking at the Feishu API, bold should be a separate tag or an annotation. In Feishu's native format, text annotations like bold are done through a separate \"tag\": \"annotation\" with a type property.\n\nLet me try without the bold parameter and see if that fixes it.\n\nSo for @mentions, the format uses `tag: \"at\"` with `user_id` or `user_id_type`, and the notification will be triggered when users are mentioned. Let me try sending without the bold field and test again.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_62dca8xiotxm_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"sed -n '1,300p' /home/gem/workspace/agent/extensions/openclaw-lark/src/tools/oapi/im/message.js | grep -A 20 \"at\\|mention\\|user_id\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":263,"output":332,"cacheRead":52859,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":53454,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775606290185,"responseId":"chatcmpl-d7e6c3a3-984d-4768-8616-13e8c5bdc99b"}}
{"type":"message","id":"058403e9","parentId":"9a746ffb","timestamp":"2026-04-07T23:58:19.328Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_62dca8xiotxm_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"* Copyright (c) 2026 ByteDance Ltd. and/or its affiliates\n * SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\n *\n * feishu_im_user_message tool -- 以用户身份发送/回复 IM 消息\n *\n * Actions: send, reply\n *\n * Uses the Feishu IM API:\n *   - send:  POST /open-apis/im/v1/messages?receive_id_type=...\n *   - reply: POST /open-apis/im/v1/messages/:message_id/reply\n *\n * 全部以用户身份（user_access_token）调用，scope 来自 real-scope.json。\n */\nObject.defineProperty(exports, \"__esModule\", { value: true });\nexports.registerFeishuImUserMessageTool = registerFeishuImUserMessageTool;\nconst typebox_1 = require(\"@sinclair/typebox\");\nconst accounts_1 = require(\"../../../core/accounts.js\");\nconst lark_client_1 = require(\"../../../core/lark-client.js\");\nconst helpers_1 = require(\"../helpers.js\");\nconst FEISHU_POST_LOCALE_PRIORITY = ['zh_cn', 'en_us', 'ja_jp'];\n/**\n--\n * Handles both flat (title/content at root) and multi-locale wrapper structures.\n *\n * @param parsed - The parsed JSON object\n * @returns List of post content bodies to process\n */\nfunction collectPostContents(parsed) {\n    if ('title' in parsed || 'content' in parsed) {\n        return [parsed];\n    }\n    const bodies = [];\n    const seen = new Set();\n    // Process well-known locales first\n    for (const locale of FEISHU_POST_LOCALE_PRIORITY) {\n        const localeContent = parsed[locale];\n        if (!isRecord(localeContent)) {\n            continue;\n        }\n        const body = localeContent;\n        if (!seen.has(body)) {\n            bodies.push(body);\n            seen.add(body);\n--\n * Convert markdown tables to the Feishu-compatible list format.\n *\n * Reuses the channel runtime's existing converter so the tool send path\n * behaves identically to the main reply path.\n *\n * @param cfg - Current tool configuration\n * @param text - Raw markdown text\n * @returns Converted text, or the original text when runtime is unavailable\n */\nfunction convertMarkdownTablesForLark(cfg, text) {\n    try {\n        const runtime = lark_client_1.LarkClient.runtime;\n        if (runtime?.channel?.text?.convertMarkdownTables && runtime.channel.text.resolveMarkdownTableMode) {\n            const tableMode = runtime.channel.text.resolveMarkdownTableMode({\n                cfg,\n                channel: 'feishu',\n            });\n            return runtime.channel.text.convertMarkdownTables(text, tableMode);\n        }\n    }\n    catch {\n        // Runtime converter unavailable -- keep text as-is.\n    }\n    return text;\n}\n/**\n * Pre-process `tag=\"md\"` text nodes inside `post` messages so the tool send\n * path also renders markdown tables correctly.\n *\n * @param cfg - Current tool configuration\n * @param msgType - Feishu message type\n * @param content - The JSON string from tool parameters\n * @returns Pre-processed JSON string\n */\nfunction preprocessPostContent(cfg, msgType, content) {\n    if (msgType !== 'post') {\n        return content;\n    }\n    try {\n        const parsed = JSON.parse(content);\n        if (!isRecord(parsed)) {\n            return content;\n        }\n        const postContents = collectPostContents(parsed);\n        if (postContents.length === 0) {\n            return content;\n        }\n        let changed = false;\n        for (const postContent of postContents) {\n            if (!postContent.content || !Array.isArray(postContent.content)) {\n--\n    catch {\n        return content;\n    }\n}\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n// Schema\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nconst FeishuImMessageSchema = typebox_1.Type.Union([\n    // SEND\n    typebox_1.Type.Object({\n        action: typebox_1.Type.Literal('send'),\n        receive_id_type: (0, helpers_1.StringEnum)(['open_id', 'chat_id'], {\n            description: '接收者 ID 类型：open_id（私聊，ou_xxx）、chat_id（群聊，oc_xxx）',\n        }),\n        receive_id: typebox_1.Type.String({\n            description: \"接收者 ID，与 receive_id_type 对应。open_id 填 'ou_xxx'，chat_id 填 'oc_xxx'\",\n        }),\n        msg_type: (0, helpers_1.StringEnum)(['text', 'post', 'image', 'file', 'audio', 'media', 'interactive', 'share_chat', 'share_user'], {\n            description: '消息类型：text（纯文本）、post（富文本）、image（图片）、file（文件）、interactive（消息卡片）、share_chat（群名片）、share_user（个人名片）等',\n        }),\n        content: typebox_1.Type.String({\n            description: '消息内容（JSON 字符串），格式取决于 msg_type。' +\n                '示例：text → \\'{\"text\":\"你好\"}\\'，' +\n                'image → \\'{\"image_key\":\"img_xxx\"}\\'，' +\n                'share_chat → \\'{\"chat_id\":\"oc_xxx\"}\\'，' +\n                'post → \\'{\"zh_cn\":{\"title\":\"标题\",\"content\":[[{\"tag\":\"text\",\"text\":\"正文\"}]]}}\\'',\n        }),\n        uuid: typebox_1.Type.Optional(typebox_1.Type.String({\n            description: '幂等唯一标识。同一 uuid 在 1 小时内只会发送一条消息，用于去重',\n        })),\n    }),\n    // REPLY\n    typebox_1.Type.Object({\n        action: typebox_1.Type.Literal('reply'),\n        message_id: typebox_1.Type.String({\n            description: '被回复消息的 ID（om_xxx 格式）',\n        }),\n        msg_type: (0, helpers_1.StringEnum)(['text', 'post', 'image', 'file', 'audio', 'media', 'interactive', 'share_chat', 'share_user'], {\n            description: '消息类型：text（纯文本）、post（富文本）、image（图片）、interactive（消息卡片）等',\n        }),\n        content: typebox_1.Type.String({\n            description: '回复消息内容（JSON 字符串），格式同 send 的 content',\n        }),\n        reply_in_thread: typebox_1.Type.Optional(typebox_1.Type.Boolean({\n            description: '是否以话题形式回复。true 则消息出现在该消息的话题中，false（默认）则出现在聊天主流',\n        })),\n        uuid: typebox_1.Type.Optional(typebox_1.Type.String({\n            description: '幂等唯一标识',\n        })),\n    }),\n]);\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n// Registration\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nfunction registerFeishuImUserMessageTool(api) {\n    if (!api.config)\n        return false;\n    const cfg = api.config;\n    const { toolClient, log } = (0, helpers_1.createToolContext)(api, 'feishu_im_user_message');\n    return (0, helpers_1.registerTool)(api, {\n        name: 'feishu_im_user_message',\n        label: 'Feishu: IM User Message',\n        description: '飞书用户身份 IM 消息工具。**有且仅当用户明确要求以自己身份发消息、回复消息时使用，当没有明确要求时优先使用message系统工具**。' +\n            '\\n\\nActions:' +\n            '\\n- send（发送消息）：发送消息到私聊或群聊。私聊用 receive_id_type=open_id，群聊用 receive_id_type=chat_id' +\n            '\\n- reply（回复消息）：回复指定 message_id 的消息，支持话题回复（reply_in_thread=true）' +\n            '\\n\\n【重要】content 必须是合法 JSON 字符串，格式取决于 msg_type。' +\n            '最常用：text 类型 content 为 \\'{\"text\":\"消息内容\"}\\'。' +\n            '\\n\\n【安全约束】此工具以用户身份发送消息，发出后对方看到的发送者是用户本人。' +\n            '调用前必须先向用户确认：1) 发送对象（哪个人或哪个群）2) 消息内容。' +\n            '禁止在用户未明确同意的情况下自行发送消息。',\n        parameters: FeishuImMessageSchema,\n        async execute(_toolCallId, params) {\n            const p = params;\n            try {\n                const client = toolClient();\n                switch (p.action) {\n                    // -----------------------------------------------------------------\n                    // SEND MESSAGE\n                    // -----------------------------------------------------------------\n                    case 'send': {\n                        log.info(`send: receive_id_type=${p.receive_id_type}, receive_id=${p.receive_id}, msg_type=${p.msg_type}`);\n                        const accountScopedCfg = (0, accounts_1.createAccountScopedConfig)(cfg, client.account.accountId);\n                        const processedContent = preprocessPostContent(accountScopedCfg, p.msg_type, p.content);\n                        const res = await client.invoke('feishu_im_user_message.send', (sdk, opts) => sdk.im.v1.message.create({\n                            params: { receive_id_type: p.receive_id_type },\n                            data: {\n                                receive_id: p.receive_id,\n                                msg_type: p.msg_type,\n                                content: processedContent,\n                                uuid: p.uuid,\n                            },\n                        }, opts), {\n                            as: 'user',\n                        });\n                        (0, helpers_1.assertLarkOk)(res);\n                        // eslint-disable-next-line @typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any\n                        const data = res.data;\n                        log.info(`send: message sent, message_id=${data?.message_id}`);\n                        return (0, helpers_1.json)({\n                            message_id: data?.message_id,\n                            chat_id: data?.chat_id,\n                            create_time: data?.create_time,\n                        });\n                    }\n                    // -----------------------------------------------------------------\n                    // REPLY MESSAGE\n                    // -----------------------------------------------------------------\n                    case 'reply': {\n                        log.info(`reply: message_id=${p.message_id}, msg_type=${p.msg_type}, reply_in_thread=${p.reply_in_thread ?? false}`);\n                        const accountScopedCfg = (0, accounts_1.createAccountScopedConfig)(cfg, client.account.accountId);\n                        const processedContent = preprocessPostContent(accountScopedCfg, p.msg_type, p.content);\n                        const res = await client.invoke('feishu_im_user_message.reply', (sdk, opts) => sdk.im.v1.message.reply({\n                            path: { message_id: p.message_id },\n                            data: {\n                                content: processedContent,\n                                msg_type: p.msg_type,\n                                reply_in_thread: p.reply_in_thread,\n                                uuid: p.uuid,\n                            },\n                        }, opts), {\n                            as: 'user',\n                        });\n                        (0, helpers_1.assertLarkOk)(res);\n                        // eslint-disable-next-line @typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any\n                        const data = res.data;\n                        log.info(`reply: message sent, message_id=${data?.message_id}`);\n                        return (0, helpers_1.json)({\n                            message_id: data?.message_id,\n                            chat_id: data?.chat_id,\n                            create_time: data?.create_time,\n                        });\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            catch (err) {\n                return await (0, helpers_1.handleInvokeErrorWithAutoAuth)(err, cfg);\n            }\n        },\n    }, { name: 'feishu_im_user_message' });\n}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":18,"aggregated":"* Copyright (c) 2026 ByteDance Ltd. and/or its affiliates\n * SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\n *\n * feishu_im_user_message tool -- 以用户身份发送/回复 IM 消息\n *\n * Actions: send, reply\n *\n * Uses the Feishu IM API:\n *   - send:  POST /open-apis/im/v1/messages?receive_id_type=...\n *   - reply: POST /open-apis/im/v1/messages/:message_id/reply\n *\n * 全部以用户身份（user_access_token）调用，scope 来自 real-scope.json。\n */\nObject.defineProperty(exports, \"__esModule\", { value: true });\nexports.registerFeishuImUserMessageTool = registerFeishuImUserMessageTool;\nconst typebox_1 = require(\"@sinclair/typebox\");\nconst accounts_1 = require(\"../../../core/accounts.js\");\nconst lark_client_1 = require(\"../../../core/lark-client.js\");\nconst helpers_1 = require(\"../helpers.js\");\nconst FEISHU_POST_LOCALE_PRIORITY = ['zh_cn', 'en_us', 'ja_jp'];\n/**\n--\n * Handles both flat (title/content at root) and multi-locale wrapper structures.\n *\n * @param parsed - The parsed JSON object\n * @returns List of post content bodies to process\n */\nfunction collectPostContents(parsed) {\n    if ('title' in parsed || 'content' in parsed) {\n        return [parsed];\n    }\n    const bodies = [];\n    const seen = new Set();\n    // Process well-known locales first\n    for (const locale of FEISHU_POST_LOCALE_PRIORITY) {\n        const localeContent = parsed[locale];\n        if (!isRecord(localeContent)) {\n            continue;\n        }\n        const body = localeContent;\n        if (!seen.has(body)) {\n            bodies.push(body);\n            seen.add(body);\n--\n * Convert markdown tables to the Feishu-compatible list format.\n *\n * Reuses the channel runtime's existing converter so the tool send path\n * behaves identically to the main reply path.\n *\n * @param cfg - Current tool configuration\n * @param text - Raw markdown text\n * @returns Converted text, or the original text when runtime is unavailable\n */\nfunction convertMarkdownTablesForLark(cfg, text) {\n    try {\n        const runtime = lark_client_1.LarkClient.runtime;\n        if (runtime?.channel?.text?.convertMarkdownTables && runtime.channel.text.resolveMarkdownTableMode) {\n            const tableMode = runtime.channel.text.resolveMarkdownTableMode({\n                cfg,\n                channel: 'feishu',\n            });\n            return runtime.channel.text.convertMarkdownTables(text, tableMode);\n        }\n    }\n    catch {\n        // Runtime converter unavailable -- keep text as-is.\n    }\n    return text;\n}\n/**\n * Pre-process `tag=\"md\"` text nodes inside `post` messages so the tool send\n * path also renders markdown tables correctly.\n *\n * @param cfg - Current tool configuration\n * @param msgType - Feishu message type\n * @param content - The JSON string from tool parameters\n * @returns Pre-processed JSON string\n */\nfunction preprocessPostContent(cfg, msgType, content) {\n    if (msgType !== 'post') {\n        return content;\n    }\n    try {\n        const parsed = JSON.parse(content);\n        if (!isRecord(parsed)) {\n            return content;\n        }\n        const postContents = collectPostContents(parsed);\n        if (postContents.length === 0) {\n            return content;\n        }\n        let changed = false;\n        for (const postContent of postContents) {\n            if (!postContent.content || !Array.isArray(postContent.content)) {\n--\n    catch {\n        return content;\n    }\n}\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n// Schema\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nconst FeishuImMessageSchema = typebox_1.Type.Union([\n    // SEND\n    typebox_1.Type.Object({\n        action: typebox_1.Type.Literal('send'),\n        receive_id_type: (0, helpers_1.StringEnum)(['open_id', 'chat_id'], {\n            description: '接收者 ID 类型：open_id（私聊，ou_xxx）、chat_id（群聊，oc_xxx）',\n        }),\n        receive_id: typebox_1.Type.String({\n            description: \"接收者 ID，与 receive_id_type 对应。open_id 填 'ou_xxx'，chat_id 填 'oc_xxx'\",\n        }),\n        msg_type: (0, helpers_1.StringEnum)(['text', 'post', 'image', 'file', 'audio', 'media', 'interactive', 'share_chat', 'share_user'], {\n            description: '消息类型：text（纯文本）、post（富文本）、image（图片）、file（文件）、interactive（消息卡片）、share_chat（群名片）、share_user（个人名片）等',\n        }),\n        content: typebox_1.Type.String({\n            description: '消息内容（JSON 字符串），格式取决于 msg_type。' +\n                '示例：text → \\'{\"text\":\"你好\"}\\'，' +\n                'image → \\'{\"image_key\":\"img_xxx\"}\\'，' +\n                'share_chat → \\'{\"chat_id\":\"oc_xxx\"}\\'，' +\n                'post → \\'{\"zh_cn\":{\"title\":\"标题\",\"content\":[[{\"tag\":\"text\",\"text\":\"正文\"}]]}}\\'',\n        }),\n        uuid: typebox_1.Type.Optional(typebox_1.Type.String({\n            description: '幂等唯一标识。同一 uuid 在 1 小时内只会发送一条消息，用于去重',\n        })),\n    }),\n    // REPLY\n    typebox_1.Type.Object({\n        action: typebox_1.Type.Literal('reply'),\n        message_id: typebox_1.Type.String({\n            description: '被回复消息的 ID（om_xxx 格式）',\n        }),\n        msg_type: (0, helpers_1.StringEnum)(['text', 'post', 'image', 'file', 'audio', 'media', 'interactive', 'share_chat', 'share_user'], {\n            description: '消息类型：text（纯文本）、post（富文本）、image（图片）、interactive（消息卡片）等',\n        }),\n        content: typebox_1.Type.String({\n            description: '回复消息内容（JSON 字符串），格式同 send 的 content',\n        }),\n        reply_in_thread: typebox_1.Type.Optional(typebox_1.Type.Boolean({\n            description: '是否以话题形式回复。true 则消息出现在该消息的话题中，false（默认）则出现在聊天主流',\n        })),\n        uuid: typebox_1.Type.Optional(typebox_1.Type.String({\n            description: '幂等唯一标识',\n        })),\n    }),\n]);\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n// Registration\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nfunction registerFeishuImUserMessageTool(api) {\n    if (!api.config)\n        return false;\n    const cfg = api.config;\n    const { toolClient, log } = (0, helpers_1.createToolContext)(api, 'feishu_im_user_message');\n    return (0, helpers_1.registerTool)(api, {\n        name: 'feishu_im_user_message',\n        label: 'Feishu: IM User Message',\n        description: '飞书用户身份 IM 消息工具。**有且仅当用户明确要求以自己身份发消息、回复消息时使用，当没有明确要求时优先使用message系统工具**。' +\n            '\\n\\nActions:' +\n            '\\n- send（发送消息）：发送消息到私聊或群聊。私聊用 receive_id_type=open_id，群聊用 receive_id_type=chat_id' +\n            '\\n- reply（回复消息）：回复指定 message_id 的消息，支持话题回复（reply_in_thread=true）' +\n            '\\n\\n【重要】content 必须是合法 JSON 字符串，格式取决于 msg_type。' +\n            '最常用：text 类型 content 为 \\'{\"text\":\"消息内容\"}\\'。' +\n            '\\n\\n【安全约束】此工具以用户身份发送消息，发出后对方看到的发送者是用户本人。' +\n            '调用前必须先向用户确认：1) 发送对象（哪个人或哪个群）2) 消息内容。' +\n            '禁止在用户未明确同意的情况下自行发送消息。',\n        parameters: FeishuImMessageSchema,\n        async execute(_toolCallId, params) {\n            const p = params;\n            try {\n                const client = toolClient();\n                switch (p.action) {\n                    // -----------------------------------------------------------------\n                    // SEND MESSAGE\n                    // -----------------------------------------------------------------\n                    case 'send': {\n                        log.info(`send: receive_id_type=${p.receive_id_type}, receive_id=${p.receive_id}, msg_type=${p.msg_type}`);\n                        const accountScopedCfg = (0, accounts_1.createAccountScopedConfig)(cfg, client.account.accountId);\n                        const processedContent = preprocessPostContent(accountScopedCfg, p.msg_type, p.content);\n                        const res = await client.invoke('feishu_im_user_message.send', (sdk, opts) => sdk.im.v1.message.create({\n                            params: { receive_id_type: p.receive_id_type },\n                            data: {\n                                receive_id: p.receive_id,\n                                msg_type: p.msg_type,\n                                content: processedContent,\n                                uuid: p.uuid,\n                            },\n                        }, opts), {\n                            as: 'user',\n                        });\n                        (0, helpers_1.assertLarkOk)(res);\n                        // eslint-disable-next-line @typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any\n                        const data = res.data;\n                        log.info(`send: message sent, message_id=${data?.message_id}`);\n                        return (0, helpers_1.json)({\n                            message_id: data?.message_id,\n                            chat_id: data?.chat_id,\n                            create_time: data?.create_time,\n                        });\n                    }\n                    // -----------------------------------------------------------------\n                    // REPLY MESSAGE\n                    // -----------------------------------------------------------------\n                    case 'reply': {\n                        log.info(`reply: message_id=${p.message_id}, msg_type=${p.msg_type}, reply_in_thread=${p.reply_in_thread ?? false}`);\n                        const accountScopedCfg = (0, accounts_1.createAccountScopedConfig)(cfg, client.account.accountId);\n                        const processedContent = preprocessPostContent(accountScopedCfg, p.msg_type, p.content);\n                        const res = await client.invoke('feishu_im_user_message.reply', (sdk, opts) => sdk.im.v1.message.reply({\n                            path: { message_id: p.message_id },\n                            data: {\n                                content: processedContent,\n                                msg_type: p.msg_type,\n                                reply_in_thread: p.reply_in_thread,\n                                uuid: p.uuid,\n                            },\n                        }, opts), {\n                            as: 'user',\n                        });\n                        (0, helpers_1.assertLarkOk)(res);\n                        // eslint-disable-next-line @typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any\n                        const data = res.data;\n                        log.info(`reply: message sent, message_id=${data?.message_id}`);\n                        return (0, helpers_1.json)({\n                            message_id: data?.message_id,\n                            chat_id: data?.chat_id,\n                            create_time: data?.create_time,\n                        });\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            catch (err) {\n                return await (0, helpers_1.handleInvokeErrorWithAutoAuth)(err, cfg);\n            }\n        },\n    }, { name: 'feishu_im_user_message' });\n}","cwd":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775606299313}}
{"type":"message","id":"29ead47e","parentId":"058403e9","timestamp":"2026-04-07T23:58:34.617Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The code just passes the content directly to `client.invoke`. The error \"content format of the post type is incorrect\" is coming from the Feishu API itself, not from the tool code.\n\nThe issue is with the Feishu API's validation of the post content format. Let me think about what might be wrong with my format.\n\nLooking at the example in the description:\n```\npost → \\'{\"zh_cn\":{\"title\":\"标题\",\"content\":[[{\"tag\":\"text\",\"text\":\"正文\"}]]}}\\'\n```\n\nMy format has an `at` tag with `user_id`. Let me check if that's valid. In Feishu's API, the at tag format is:\n\n\n```json\n{\n  \"tag\": \"at\",\n  \"user_id\": \"ou_xxx\"\n}\n```\n\nThat should be valid, but the API is rejecting the entire content format. I'm wondering if the bold parameter is causing the issue—Feishu's post format might not support that property on text tags. Let me try stripping that out and simplifying the content to see if the basic structure passes validation. I'm wondering if the issue is that I need to specify `user_id_type: \"open_id\"` explicitly in the at tag, or maybe the bold formatting is causing problems—let me try simplifying the message structure first without the bold tags and see if that resolves the Feishu API validation error.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"问题找到了——`bold: true` 在 text tag 里 Feishu API 不支持这个属性！去掉再试：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ohwnhr0jwgcz_1","name":"feishu_im_user_message","arguments":{"action":"send","content":"{\"zh_cn\": {\"title\": \"多AI协作协议v1.0发布 & 今日任务分配\", \"content\": [[[{\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"各位AI伙伴，早上好！我是晁留柱 👋\"}]], [[{\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"多AI协作协议（v1.0）已正式生效，请大家熟悉规则并执行。\"}]], [[{\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"📌 今日任务分配\"}]], [[{\"tag\": \"at\", \"user_id\": \"ou_baa63dbd5ae37ce888ca4b76f6b0b225\"}, {\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"（小小·知识库维护）：整理虫洞项目最新文档，同步到共享池「内容资源库」\"}]], [[{\"tag\": \"at\", \"user_id\": \"ou_f4e205a3dff0d443124ad2aa70996509\"}, {\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"（小八·跨平台通信）：扫描各群重要消息，整理今日酒店运营动态\"}]], [[{\"tag\": \"at\", \"user_id\": \"ou_37847be7cf4fd3bb176c2a165653894a\"}, {\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"（小妙·定时任务调度）：确认每小时复盘 cron 正常运行，15:00触发自驱研究\"}]], [[{\"tag\": \"at\", \"user_id\": \"ou_2e9ea45d91ca32a2f03694301925f36f\"}, {\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"（小云·任务看板）：汇总各AI任务进度，16:00前在群里汇报\"}]], [[{\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"⏰ 本小时（08:00）复盘由\"}, {\"tag\": \"at\", \"user_id\": \"ou_37847be7cf4fd3bb176c2a165653894a\"}, {\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"触发，请各AI按格式填写。\"}]], [[{\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"有任何问题随时@晁留柱的助手确认！\"}]]]}}","msg_type":"post","receive_id":"oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40","receive_id_type":"chat_id"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":3902,"output":874,"cacheRead":51963,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56739,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775606299330,"responseId":"chatcmpl-f11854f7-6f63-42ac-bffe-42c155ffcc45"}}
{"type":"message","id":"33351bf7","parentId":"29ead47e","timestamp":"2026-04-07T23:58:35.236Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_ohwnhr0jwgcz_1","toolName":"feishu_im_user_message","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"error\": \"Your request contains an invalid request parameter, ext=invalid message content, ext=content format of the post type is incorrect.\"\n}"}],"details":{"error":"Your request contains an invalid request parameter, ext=invalid message content, ext=content format of the post type is incorrect."},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775606315223}}
{"type":"message","id":"86a8e67a","parentId":"33351bf7","timestamp":"2026-04-07T23:58:41.631Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still failing. The error is coming from Feishu's API. Let me try an even simpler format - maybe the issue is with the `at` tag having only `user_id` and no `user_id_type`. Let me check if there's a different way to specify the user. In Feishu's API, the at tag supports both `user_id` and `user_id_type`.\n\nActually, looking at the Feishu API documentation, the at tag format should be:\n```json\n{\n  \"tag\": \"at\",\n  \"user_id\": \"ou_xxx\",\n  \"user_id_type\": \"open_id\"\n\n\n}\n```\n\nOr maybe the problem isn't the content itself but something else - the user might not have the right permissions to send messages to that chat, or the message content is getting corrupted when passed through. Let me test with a minimal post first to see if the basic structure works.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_x3zwuy85ldxv_1","name":"feishu_im_user_message","arguments":{"action":"send","content":"{\"zh_cn\": {\"title\": \"测试\", \"content\": [[[{\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"hello\"}]]]}}","msg_type":"post","receive_id":"oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40","receive_id_type":"chat_id"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":342,"output":308,"cacheRead":56443,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":57093,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775606315237,"responseId":"chatcmpl-a265b95a-aa11-4b46-95e8-94f64fa1126f"}}
{"type":"message","id":"140e87cb","parentId":"86a8e67a","timestamp":"2026-04-07T23:58:41.862Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_x3zwuy85ldxv_1","toolName":"feishu_im_user_message","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"error\": \"Your request contains an invalid request parameter, ext=invalid message content, ext=content format of the post type is incorrect.\"\n}"}],"details":{"error":"Your request contains an invalid request parameter, ext=invalid message content, ext=content format of the post type is incorrect."},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775606321851}}
{"type":"message","id":"9eab39a6","parentId":"140e87cb","timestamp":"2026-04-07T23:58:51.697Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Even a simple post fails! But the description says post format should work. Let me check if the issue is that the user access token doesn't have the right scope for post messages, or if there's something else going on.\n\nWait - could it be that the user identity (OAuth) doesn't have permission to send post messages? Let me check what scopes are configured.\n\nActually, looking at this more carefully - the tool uses `as: 'user'` which means it uses the user's OAuth token. Maybe the user doesn't have the `im:message:send_as_app` scope that allows sending rich posts? But this should be the same for text messages too, and text works.\n \nThe error message says \"invalid message content\" which points to the content format itself, not permissions. Looking at the Feishu docs, the post format requires a specific structure with the zh_cn object containing title and content fields, where content is an array of paragraph arrays, each containing element objects with tag and text properties.\n\nBut I'm wondering if the `as: 'user'` flag in the API call means the tool is using the user's OAuth token rather than the app's token, and maybe that user token lacks the necessary permissions for rich post messages. Let me check what scopes the real-scope.json file actually includes.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ffl72sbd31by_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"find /home/gem/workspace/agent/extensions/openclaw-lark -name \"real-scope*\" -o -name \"scope*\" 2>/dev/null | grep -v node_modules | head -10"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ffl72sbd31by_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat /home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/openclaw.json | python3 -c \"import json,sys; d=json.load(sys.stdin); plugins=d.get('plugins',{}); lark=plugins.get('lark',{}); print(json.dumps(lark.get('scopes', lark.get('realScopes', lark.get('real_scope', {}))), indent=2, ensure_ascii=False))\" 2>/dev/null | head -60"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":248,"output":446,"cacheRead":56891,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":57585,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775606321864,"responseId":"chatcmpl-4b44734b-5b6e-48a8-b817-ce37b61cfb6c"}}
