{"type":"message","id":"09a3e745","parentId":"985d2ff1","timestamp":"2026-04-08T00:06:56.217Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-08 08:06:55 GMT+8] Feishu[default] group oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40 | 晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409) [msg:om_x100b526d8f2838a8c4ffb5b1e9483ca, reply_to:om_x100b526df334aca0c4a6ea359577ee4, @bot]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b526d8f2838a8c4ffb5b1e9483ca\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40\",\n  \"sender\": \"晁留柱\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-04-08 08:06 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"[message_id=om_x100b526df334aca0c4a6ea359577ee4] 各位AI伙伴，早上好！我是晁留柱 👋\\n多AI协作协议（v1.0）已正式生效，请大家熟悉规则并执行。\\n\\n---\\n\\n📌 今日任务分配\\n@arkclaw版openclaw @晁留柱的AI助手 @腾讯云Openclaw机器人 @workbuddy应用机器人 @晁留柱\\n**@arkclaw版openclaw**（知识库维护）：整理虫洞项目最新文档，同步到共享池「内容资源库」\\n**@晁留柱的AI助手**（跨平台通信）：扫描各群重要消息，整理今日酒店运营动态\\n**@腾讯云Openclaw机器人**（定时任务调度）：确认每小时复盘 cron 正常运行，15:00触发自驱研究\\n**@workbuddy应用机器人**（任务看板）：汇总各AI任务进度，16:00前在群里汇报\\n\\n---\\n\\n⏰ 本小时（08:00）复盘由 @腾讯云Openclaw机器人 触发，请各AI按格式填写。\\n有任何问题随时@晁留柱确认！\"\n}\n```\n\n这次名称对了，“@”还是文本格式的字符，不能激活阅读，而且要以我租户身份发出消息"}],"timestamp":1775606816207}}
{"type":"message","id":"56d6f4f4","parentId":"09a3e745","timestamp":"2026-04-08T00:07:13.481Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is saying:\n1. The @ names are still showing as text (not activating notifications) - because I'm using the message tool which is bot identity, not user identity\n2. They want it sent with \"以我租户身份\" - meaning using the user token so it appears as if 晁留柱 himself sent the message\n\nThe issue is: user token doesn't support post rich text format with real @ mentions. But it supports text messages.\n\nWait - let me re-read the Feishu API docs. The user token can send text messages, and in text messages, you can use the `@_user_ou_xxxxx` format... but earlier we saw that doesn't actually trigger notifications either.\n\n\nI'm wondering if there's a different syntax for mentions in text messages, or if the card format with interactive elements might work differently than the post rich text format. The challenge is balancing whether a card could achieve the proper @ notification while still appearing to come from the user's identity.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"明白了！你说得对——现在@还是文本，伙伴们收不到通知，而且是以 bot 身份发的，不是你的身份。\n\n**根本问题**：飞书 user token 限制，无法通过 API 发真@的 post 富文本。\n\n**变通方案**：用**消息卡片**（interactive）+ **user token**，卡片里用 `mention_id` 格式才能触发真@通知。让我查一下飞书卡片的正确 mention 语法：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_fdsy6xwhy3ja_1","name":"web_search","arguments":{"count":5,"query":"飞书 open-apis 消息卡片 interactive mention @user_id 格式 2024"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":3555,"output":344,"cacheRead":61371,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":65270,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775606816218,"responseId":"chatcmpl-b568aee3-f2c9-4be5-beb5-7e0602250dd7"}}
