{"type":"message","id":"a8a99f7e","parentId":"486a8788","timestamp":"2026-04-08T00:07:52.862Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"It worked! The `<at id=\"ou_xxx\" alias=\"xxx\"></at>` syntax works in interactive cards via user token! This is the correct format.\n\nNow the message is sent with user identity AND with real @ mentions that will trigger notifications.\n\nLet me report this success to the user.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"发出去了！✅ 这次是用 user token + 卡片消息 + `<at id=\"ou_xxx\"></at>` 格式！\n\n**这就是正确语法**：在飞书卡片里用 `<at id=\"open_id\" alias=\"显示名\"></at>` 即可触发真@通知，而且以你的身份发出。\n\n马上把这个语法记到 skill 里：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_bgeuvd217pz4_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"edits":[{"newText":"### 2.2 发送规则\n\n> 🔑 **关键规则**：以租户身份发消息给AI伙伴时：\n> \n> **user token 方式（feishu_im_user_message）**：\n> - ✅ text 类型：支持，但@是纯文本\n> - ❌ post 富文本：API 拒绝（不支持）\n> - ✅ **interactive 卡片**：支持，**必须用 `<at id=\"open_id\" alias=\"显示名\"></at>` 语法**\n> \n> **正确方式**：使用 `feishu_im_user_message` + `msg_type=interactive`，卡片内容中用 `<at id=\"ou_xxx\" alias=\"机器人名\"></at>` 实现真@通知\n> \n> **示例**：\n> ```json\n> {\"tag\": \"div\", \"text\": {\"tag\": \"lark_md\", \"content\": \"<at id=\\\"ou_xxx\\\" alias=\\\"机器人名\\\"></at> 请完成任务\"}}\n> ```","oldText":"### 2.2 发送规则\n\n> 🔑 **关键规则**：以租户身份发消息给AI伙伴时：\n> - 飞书 user token（feishu_im_user_message）：不支持 post 富文本真@，text 类型仅文本\n> - **正确方式**：使用 message 工具（bot 身份），自动支持@mention\n> - 目标群：`oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40`\n> - **必须同时@晁留柱本人**（open_id: ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409）"}],"path":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/ai-partner-protocol/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":145,"output":573,"cacheRead":68539,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":69257,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775606858696,"responseId":"chatcmpl-bd89baa8-f2f5-4f79-91cd-49a3a38d4670"}}
