{"type":"message","id":"931ea288","parentId":"5ea55a11","timestamp":"2026-04-08T00:08:02.133Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Great, now let me update the daily memory too.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_v90k1h513iu3_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"edits":[{"newText":"### 08:00 任务分配 & 协作协议关键发现\n- **真实AI伙伴名单**：arkclaw版openclaw、晁留柱的AI助手（另一实例）、腾讯云Openclaw机器人、workbuddy应用机器人\n- **飞书user token真@语法**：`feishu_im_user_message` + `msg_type=interactive` + 卡片内使用 `<at id=\"ou_xxx\" alias=\"名\"></at>` = 以租户身份发消息+真@通知\n- **飞书bot真@语法**：`message` 工具直接 @用户名 = bot身份真@通知\n- **协作skill已更新**：ai-partner-protocol/SKILL.md 中伙伴列表、open_id、发送规则均已更正\n- **授权原则**：用户明确授权→确认内容→以用户/bot身份发送（选合适方式）","oldText":"### 08:00 任务分配 & 协作协议关键发现\n- **真实AI伙伴名单**：arkclaw版openclaw、晁留柱的AI助手（另一实例）、腾讯云Openclaw机器人、workbuddy应用机器人\n- **飞书user token限制**：不支持post富文本真@，只能用bot身份（message工具）发带真@的消息\n- **协作skill已更新**：ai-partner-protocol/SKILL.md 中的伙伴列表、open_id、@规范均已更正\n- **授权原则**：用户明确授权→确认内容→以用户/bot身份发送（选合适方式）"}],"path":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/memory/2026-04-08.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":316,"output":393,"cacheRead":68987,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":69696,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775606872889,"responseId":"chatcmpl-f871224b-2e33-4f22-ab89-6b502f4e2866"}}
