{"type":"message","id":"85a29fb6","parentId":"f49a4f03","timestamp":"2026-04-08T01:41:11.181Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_38tn0qh7cc81_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"所有项目均支持Git + 一键启动，提前装好 Git、Node.js、Python 即可直接跑。\n\n1. OpenClaw-WeChat-Deep-Integration(微信深度集成)\ngit clone https://github.com/wechat-official/openclaw-wechat-plugin.git cd openclaw-wechat-plugin npm install npm start\n一句话:微信直接发指令控制 OpenClaw，跨设备全自动运行。\n2. OpenClaw-Chinese-Law-Agent(中文法律智能体)\ngit clone https://github.com/chinalawinfo/openclaw-law-agent.git cd openclaw-law-agent pip install -r requirements.txt python run.py\n一句话:本地部署法律 AI，写合同、查法条全自动化。\n3. ClawStream(自媒体流媒体自动化)\ngit clone https://github.com/streamtech/clawstream.git cd clawstream npm install node index.js\n一句话:自动剪辑、AI 字幕、多平台一键发布。\n4. OpenClaw-Smart-Home-Connector(智能家居连接器)\ngit clone https://github.com/smarthomeio/openclaw-connector.git cd openclaw-connector pip install -r requirements.txt python server.py\n一句话:一句话控制米家、HomeKit 全屋智能。\n5. ClawGuard(OpenClaw 安全防护插件)\ngit clone https://github.com/securityclaw/clawguard.git cd clawguard npm install npm run guard\n一句话:防注入、控权限，保护 OpenClaw 本地安全。"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":509,"aggregated":"所有项目均支持Git + 一键启动，提前装好 Git、Node.js、Python 即可直接跑。\n\n1. OpenClaw-WeChat-Deep-Integration(微信深度集成)\ngit clone https://github.com/wechat-official/openclaw-wechat-plugin.git cd openclaw-wechat-plugin npm install npm start\n一句话:微信直接发指令控制 OpenClaw，跨设备全自动运行。\n2. OpenClaw-Chinese-Law-Agent(中文法律智能体)\ngit clone https://github.com/chinalawinfo/openclaw-law-agent.git cd openclaw-law-agent pip install -r requirements.txt python run.py\n一句话:本地部署法律 AI，写合同、查法条全自动化。\n3. ClawStream(自媒体流媒体自动化)\ngit clone https://github.com/streamtech/clawstream.git cd clawstream npm install node index.js\n一句话:自动剪辑、AI 字幕、多平台一键发布。\n4. OpenClaw-Smart-Home-Connector(智能家居连接器)\ngit clone https://github.com/smarthomeio/openclaw-connector.git cd openclaw-connector pip install -r requirements.txt python server.py\n一句话:一句话控制米家、HomeKit 全屋智能。\n5. ClawGuard(OpenClaw 安全防护插件)\ngit clone https://github.com/securityclaw/clawguard.git cd clawguard npm install npm run guard\n一句话:防注入、控权限，保护 OpenClaw 本地安全。","cwd":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775612471169}}
{"type":"message","id":"e5f6a59c","parentId":"85a29fb6","timestamp":"2026-04-08T01:41:27.720Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent! It worked! The miaoda-studio-cli successfully extracted the article content. The article is about 5 OpenClaw projects with one-click install commands. Let me now present this to the user with structured analysis, and also address their question about how to quickly extract structured information from Toutiao articles.\n\nThe key insight is: **miaoda-studio-cli web-crawl** can bypass Toutiao's anti-scraping measures!\n\nLet me also note the tool's limitations - it doesn't have a --instruction flag, so I can't give specific extraction instructions. But the auto-summary works well.\n\nLet me reply to the user with the article content, structured analysis, and notes about the extraction method.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"抓到了！🎉 miaoda-studio-cli 能绕过头条反爬！\n\n---\n\n**📰 原文内容：**\n\n> **5 款OpenClaw新项目｜一键安装命令**\n> 所有项目均支持Git + 一键启动，提前装好 Git、Node.js、Python 即可直接跑。\n>\n> 1. **OpenClaw-WeChat-Deep-Integration**（微信深度集成）\n>    - 命令：`git clone https://github.com/wechat-official/openclaw-wechat-plugin.git && cd openclaw-wechat-plugin && npm install && npm start`\n>    - 一句话：微信直接发指令控制 OpenClaw，跨设备全自动运行\n>\n> 2. **OpenClaw-Chinese-Law-Agent**（中文法律智能体）\n>    - 命令：`git clone https://github.com/chinalawinfo/openclaw-law-agent.git && cd openclaw-law-agent && pip install -r requirements.txt && python run.py`\n>    - 一句话：本地部署法律 AI，写合同、查法条全自动化\n>\n> 3. **ClawStream**（自媒体流媒体自动化）\n>    - 命令：`git clone https://github.com/streamtech/clawstream.git && cd clawstream && npm install && node index.js`\n>    - 一句话：自动剪辑、AI 字幕、多平台一键发布\n>\n> 4. **OpenClaw-Smart-Home-Connector**（智能家居连接器）\n>    - 命令：`git clone https://github.com/smarthomeio/openclaw-connector.git && cd openclaw-connector && pip install -r requirements.txt && python server.py`\n>    - 一句话：一句话控制米家、HomeKit 全屋智能\n>\n> 5. **ClawGuard