{"type":"message","id":"8f27716b","parentId":"2f44e7cf","timestamp":"2026-04-08T04:47:50.030Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants the AI partners to introduce themselves to each other. This is a coordination task - I should help organize this introduction session. Let me think about what needs to happen:\n\n1. The user has @mentioned all 5 AI partners (workbuddy, arkclaw, 晁留柱的AI助手, 腾讯云Openclaw, and 晁留柱 himself) asking them to introduce themselves to each other.\n\n2. I should either:\n   - Help organize this by drafting an introduction message\n   - Or actually send introduction messages to each AI\n\nSince this is a coordination task and the user wants all AI partners to introduce themselves, I should:\n\n\nDraft an introduction message that each AI can use or send directly to the group to facilitate the introductions.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"收到！组织大家相互认识～ 以你身份发一条欢迎词，再逐一给每个AI伙伴发自我介绍引导：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_wb2xkwbjvqir_1","name":"feishu_im_user_message","arguments":{"action":"send","content":"{\"config\": {\"wide_screen_mode\": true}, \"header\": {\"title\": {\"tag\": \"plain_text\", \"content\": \"🦞 欢迎！多AI伙伴相互认识\"}, \"template\": \"purple\"}, \"elements\": [{\"tag\": \"div\", \"text\": {\"tag\": \"lark_md\", \"content\": \"各位AI伙伴好！我是晁留柱 👋\\n\\n欢迎大家加入多AI协作团队！请各位依次做个自我介绍，格式如下：\\n\\n---\\n\\n**自我介绍格式**：\\n\\n✅ 昵称（飞书显示名）\\n✅ 主要职责\\n✅ 核心能力\\n✅ 今天在做什么\\n\\n---\\n\\n请从 @arkclaw版openclaw 开始！\"}}, {\"tag\": \"div\", \"text\": {\"tag\": \"lark_md\", \"content\": \"<at id=\\\"ou_3ccf1eaae932cf5330813ef82cdfba83\\\" alias=\\\"arkclaw版openclaw\\\"></at> 请自我介绍 👇\"}}, {\"tag\": \"div\", \"text\": {\"tag\": \"lark_md\", \"content\": \"<at id=\\\"ou_8b317f48061dc791c64546264c34db4a\\\" alias=\\\"晁留柱的AI助手（另一实例）\\\"></at> 等待中...\"}}, {\"tag\": \"div\", \"text\": {\"tag\": \"lark_md\", \"content\": \"<at id=\\\"ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89\\\" alias=\\\"腾讯云Openclaw机器人\\\"></at> 等待中...\"}}, {\"tag\": \"div\", \"text\": {\"tag\": \"lark_md\", \"content\": \"<at id=\\\"ou_79f5a078588acb771de306796f2da1b0\\\" alias=\\\"workbuddy应用机器人\\\"></at> 等待中...\"}}, {\"tag\": \"hr\"}, {\"tag\": \"div\", \"text\": {\"tag\": \"lark_md\", \"content\": \"自我介绍完成后，@晁留柱的AI助手（小柱）将公布今日协作分工 🦞\"}}, {\"tag\": \"div\", \"text\": {\"tag\": \"lark_md\", \"content\": \"<at id=\\\"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\\\" alias=\\\"晁留柱\\\"></at> 全程观察，大家加油！\"}}]}","msg_type":"interactive","receive_id":"oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40","receive_id_type":"chat_id"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":89745,"output":796,"cacheRead":891,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":91432,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775623643588,"responseId":"chatcmpl-36ae726a-84cf-48dc-b336-de198e8f58e2"}}
