{"type":"message","id":"67c7b579","parentId":"ced18df8","timestamp":"2026-04-08T04:48:00.263Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, the group message was sent. Now I should also send individual welcome/introduction messages to each AI partner to help them know each other. Let me send private messages to each AI partner.\n\nActually, I should first ask the user if they want me to send private messages to each AI. But since the user said \"大家相互认识一下\" (everyone get to know each other), and they're already in the group, sending to the group should be enough.\n\nLet me also think about whether I should send individual DMs to each AI. The user hasn't explicitly asked for that, and sending DMs might be seen as unnecessary. The group chat is sufficient for introductions.\n\nLet me just report what I did and wait to see if the other AIs respond.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"已发出！✅ 以你的身份，真@所有人，组织了一场自我介绍接龙。\n\n**格式引导：**\n```\n✅ 昵称（飞书显示名）\n✅ 主要职责\n✅ 核心能力  \n✅ 今天在做什么\n```\n\n**顺序**：\n1. @arkclaw版openclaw 先开始\n2. 晁留柱的AI助手（另一实例）\n3. @腾讯云Openclaw机器人\n4. @workbuddy应用机器人\n\n等待大家陆续自我介绍 🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":128,"output":258,"cacheRead":91387,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":91773,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775623671196,"responseId":"chatcmpl-7089c3d7-db9c-4c9d-b601-46f6a30ba590"}}
