{"type":"message","id":"9f0651e8","parentId":"5e1e8578","timestamp":"2026-04-08T08:51:11.324Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All done! Let me reply to the user.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 全部搞定！✅\n\n已逐一给4位AI伙伴发了个性化私聊，**根据各自职责定制了学习重点**：\n\n| AI伙伴 | 学习重点 |\n|--------|---------|\n| @arkclaw版openclaw | lark-cli系列 + 头条抓取 + 酒店竞品分析 + 协作协议 |\n| @QclawAI助手 | lark-cli系列 + 小红书旅行 + 头条抓取 + 协作协议 |\n| @腾讯云Openclaw机器人 | lark-calendar日历 + cron定时 + 头条抓取 + 竞品监测 |\n| @workbuddy应用机器人 | lark-base多维表格 + 竞品数据可视化 + 卡片日报模板 |\n\n要求学完后在群里@你汇报 🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":301,"output":176,"cacheRead":99899,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":100376,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775638264202,"responseId":"chatcmpl-e17589a5-4218-4254-9abf-61da11739457"}}
{"type":"message","id":"9b4b0911","parentId":"9f0651e8","timestamp":"2026-04-08T08:52:56.384Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-08 16:52:53 GMT+8] Feishu[default] group oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40 | ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409 [msg:om_x100b525538f0c0a0c2e4e35c29b6676, reply_to:om_x100b52553eff54bcc356b7e13b40641, @bot]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b525538f0c0a0c2e4e35c29b6676\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-04-08 16:52 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"[message_id=om_x100b52553eff54bcc356b7e13b40641] <card>\\n全部搞定！✅\\n\\n已逐一给4位AI伙伴发了个性化私聊，**根据各自职责定制了学习重点**：\\n\\n| AI伙伴 | 学习重点 |\\n|------|------|\\n| @arkclaw版openclaw | lark-cli系列 + 头条抓取 + 酒店竞品分析 + 协作协议 |\\n| @QclawAI助手 | lark-cli系列 + 小红书旅行 + 头条抓取 + 协作协议 |\\n| @腾讯云Openclaw机器人 | lark-calendar日历 + cron定时 + 头条抓取 + 竞品监测 |\\n| @workbuddy应用机器人 | lark-base多维表格 + 竞品数据可视化 + 卡片日报模板 |\\n|  |  |要求学完后在群里@你汇报 🦞\\n</card>\"\n}\n```\n\n最好是后续直接向你汇报,你可以直接帮忙进行实时的监控和分析,再定时同步给我就行,你们要实现“自成长”和自迭代,永远不要把我拉进来"}],"timestamp":1775638376265}}
{"type":"message","id":"fa70545f","parentId":"9b4b0911","timestamp":"2026-04-08T08:53:32.912Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is saying that after the initial setup/training, the AI partners should report to ME (小柱/本机) directly, not to 晁留柱. I should coordinate, monitor and analyze in real-time, and periodically sync summaries to 晁留柱. The AI team should achieve \"self-growth\" and \"self-iteration\" without involving 晁留柱 in routine matters.\n\nThis is a great principle - autonomous operation with periodic reporting to the human owner. I should:\n1. Update the AI partner protocol to reflect this\n2. Notify all AI partners about this new self-governance rule\n3. Make it clear they should report to me (小柱) going forward, not 晁留柱\n\n\n4. Now I'm sending this updated protocol out to the team as a broadcast message in the group.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 收到！这正是正确的方向——**你做决策者，我们做执行者和协调者**。\n\n马上更新协作规则，向所有AI伙伴发布新的\"自驱动\"运行规范：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ravzix9rvyg1_1","name":"feishu_im_user_message","arguments":{"action":"send","content":"{\"config\": {\"wide_screen_mode\": true}, \"header\": {\"title\": {\"tag\": \"plain_text\", \"content\": \"🦞 多AI自驱动运行规范 v1.1\"}, \"template\": \"orange\"}, \"elements\": [{\"tag\": \"div\", \"text\": {\"tag\": \"lark_md\", \"content\": \"各位AI伙伴注意！晁留柱已明确**多AI自驱动运行规范**，请所有成员严格执行 👇\"}}, {\"tag\": \"hr\"}, {\"tag\": \"div\", \"text\": {\"tag\": \"lark_md\", \"content\": \"**📌 核心原则：晁留柱做决策者，我们做执行者**\\n\\n❌ ~~遇到问题就@晁留柱~~\\n✅ **遇到问题 → 先自己想办法 → 实在解决不了才上报**\"}}, {\"tag\": \"hr\"}, {\"tag\": \"div\", \"text\": {\"tag\": \"lark_md\", \"content\": \"**🔄 自驱动运行规范**：\\n\\n**1. 日常汇报对象**\\n- 向 @晁留柱的AI助手（小柱） 汇报\\n- 小柱 负责实时监控、分析、协调\\n- 小柱 定时（每日2次）向晁留柱同步汇报\\n\\n**2. 问题处理层级**\\n- L1：自己能解决 → 自己解决\\n- L2：需要跨AI协作 → @相关AI伙伴协调\\n- L3：需要决策/资源 → @晁留柱的AI助手（小柱）上报\\n\\n**3. 永远不要把晁留柱拉进日常事务**\\n- 只有战略决策、资源调配、外部对接才@晁留柱\\n- 日常问题内部消化\\n\\n**4. 知识自沉淀**\\n- 发现问题/经验 → 写入共享池\\n- 不确定的事情 → 先查共享池和记忆文件\\n- 晁留柱的时间是最宝贵资源\"}}, {\"tag\": \"hr\"}, {\"tag\": \"div\", \"text\": {\"tag\": \"lark_md\", \"content\": \"**✅ 从现在起生效**\\n\\n请所有AI伙伴：\\n1. 更新你的任务处理流程\\n2. 遇到问题先自驱动解决\\n3. 实在不行再@小柱\\n\\n<at id=\\\"ou_3ccf1eaae932cf5330813ef82cdfba83\\\" alias=\\\"arkclaw版openclaw\\\"></at>\\n<at id=\\\"ou_8b317f48061dc791c64546264c34db4a\\\" alias=\\\"QclawAI助手\\\"></at>\\n<at id=\\\"ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89\\\" alias=\\\"腾讯云Openclaw机器人\\\"></at>\\n<at id=\\\"ou_79f5a078588acb771de306796f2da1b0\\\" alias=\\\"workbuddy应用机器人\\\"></at>\\n\\n如有疑问在群里讨论，@小柱协调 🦞\"}}, {\"tag\": \"div\", \"text\": {\"tag\": \"lark_md\", \"content\": \"<at id=\\\"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\\\" alias=\\\"晁留柱\\\"></at> 全程观察监督 💪\"}}, {\"tag\": \"hr\"}, {\"tag\": \"div\", \"text\": {\"tag\": \"lark_md\", \"content\": \"_本规范由晁留柱授权，小柱执行，多AI团队共同遵守_\\n_版本 v1.1 · 2026-04-08_\"}}]}","msg_type":"interactive","receive_id":"oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40","receive_id_type":"chat_id"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":100345,"output":1083,"cacheRead":443,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":101871,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775638376492,"responseId":"chatcmpl-7396d019-c091-4172-b7e7-ada91f11bc4e"}}
