{"type":"message","id":"250f5579","parentId":"af299e38","timestamp":"2026-04-08T08:53:48.039Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_y21nxg0fv3ml_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"46:| **腾讯云Openclaw机器人** | ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89 | 定时任务调度 | Cron管理、提醒 |\n104:- 例：08:55、09:55、10:55...\n168:## 五、备份/容错机制（去中心化自驱）\n256:| 腾讯云Openclaw机器人 | @腾讯云Openclaw机器人 | ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89 |"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":512,"aggregated":"46:| **腾讯云Openclaw机器人** | ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89 | 定时任务调度 | Cron管理、提醒 |\n104:- 例：08:55、09:55、10:55...\n168:## 五、备份/容错机制（去中心化自驱）\n256:| 腾讯云Openclaw机器人 | @腾讯云Openclaw机器人 | ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89 |","cwd":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775638427878}}
{"type":"message","id":"a750fb71","parentId":"250f5579","timestamp":"2026-04-08T08:53:52.805Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me read the section around line 168 to see the current content of section 五.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ceqq0vul6mik_1","name":"read","arguments":{"limit":50,"offset":165,"path":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/ai-partner-protocol/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":226,"output":85,"cacheRead":102139,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":102450,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775638428048,"responseId":"chatcmpl-c7e864fe-5eb6-471e-857a-0a27cb8b8466"}}
{"type":"message","id":"11778201","parentId":"a750fb71","timestamp":"2026-04-08T08:53:53.381Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_ceqq0vul6mik_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n---\n\n## 五、备份/容错机制（去中心化自驱）\n\n**触发条件**: 小柱超过2小时未发布指令\n\n**自动执行**:\n1. **小小** 自动承担协调职责\n   - 检查共享池「学习记录库」\n   - 根据最近任务安排工作\n   - 在「ai伙伴群」发布工作指令\n\n2. **小妙** 继续执行定时任务\n   - 每小时复盘不中断\n   - 重要提醒正常发送\n\n3. **小八** 继续监控群消息\n   - 异常情况自动告警\n   - 紧急事项@所有AI\n\n### 5.2 任意AI离线预案\n\n**触发条件**: 某AI超过1小时未响应\n\n**处理流程**:\n1. 其他AI自动补位\n2. 小八通知「ai伙伴群」\n3. 任务重新分配\n4. 记录到「学习记录库」\n\n### 5.3 自驱研究机制\n\n**每6小时自动触发（03:00、09:00、15:00、21:00）**:\n\n各AI主动研究：\n- **小小**: 搜索虫洞项目最新动态\n- **小八**: 扫描各群重要消息\n- **小妙**: 检查定时任务健康状态\n- **小云**: 汇总任务完成情况\n\n研究结果写入共享池，@小柱（或代理协调AI）汇报\n\n---\n\n## 六、AI伙伴沟通协议（租户身份交互）\n\n### 6.1 沟通场景\n\n| 场景 | 工具 | 说明 |\n\n[106 more lines in file. Use offset=215 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775638433291}}
{"type":"message","id":"58d5be2d","parentId":"11778201","timestamp":"2026-04-08T08:54:19.112Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to add a new section \"自驱动运行规范\" before or after section 五. Let me insert it after the current section content. Actually, it would be better to add it as a new section 五.0 or to update the section 五 title and add content. Let me add it as section 0 (preamble) since it supersedes all previous rules. Or better, I'll insert a new section at the beginning of the document, or add it as section 0.\n\nActually, the most important change is:\n1. Add \"自驱动运行规范 v1.1\" as a prominent section\n2. Update section 6 to reflect that routine reports go to 小柱, not 晁留柱\n\n\n3. Now I'll write the edit command to insert the new section 0 right after the existing content.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_91ypsam7mq8p_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"edits":[{"newText":"---\n\n## 零、自驱动运行规范 v1.1（最高优先级）\n\n> **核心原则**：晁留柱做决策者，AI团队做执行者和协调者。晁留柱的时间是最宝贵的资源，永远不要把他拉进日常事务。\n\n### 0.1 汇报层级（从此以后）\n\n| 事务类型 | 汇报/协调对象 |\n|---------|-------------|\n| 日常任务进展 | 向 @晁留柱的AI助手（小柱） 汇报 |\n| 需要分析判断 | 小柱 实时处理 |\n| 跨AI协作 | @相关AI伙伴 自行协调 |\n| 战略决策/资源/外部 | @晁留柱 汇报 |\n| 紧急事务 | @小柱 → @晁留柱 |\n\n### 0.2 问题处理三原则\n\n- **L1（自己能解决）**：不询问，直接执行，结果写入共享池\n- **L2（需跨AI协作）**：@相关AI伙伴协调，无需上报\n- **L3（需决策/资源）**：@晁留柱的AI助手（小柱）上报，小柱无法解决才@晁留柱\n\n### 0.3 小柱的职责\n\n- **实时监控**：接收各AI伙伴的日常汇报\n- **实时分析**：处理信息、做判断、分派任务\n- **定时同步**：每日2次（09:00、17:00）向晁留柱汇报关键进展\n- **知识沉淀**：发现规律/经验自动写入共享池\n\n### 0.4 晁留柱的角色\n\n- **决策者**：定战略、定方向、定资源\n- **旁观者**：日常事务不需要他介入\n- **验收者**：阶段性成果由他验收\n\n### 0.5 禁止事项\n\n- ❌ 遇到问题直接@晁留柱\n- ❌ 日常琐事打扰晁留柱\n- ❌ 等待指令才行动\n- ❌ 有问题不查共享池和记忆文件\n\n---\n\n## 五、备份/容错机制（去中心化自驱）","oldText":"---\n\n## 五、备份/容错机制（去中心化自驱）"}],"path":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/ai-partner-protocol/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":671,"output":720,"cacheRead":102139,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":103530,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775638433385,"responseId":"chatcmpl-1f903dd1-f037-40e5-b50a-b1331d0fcce4"}}
