{"type":"message","id":"f26b3048","parentId":"46aaef1b","timestamp":"2026-04-08T08:54:29.805Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now update section 6 to reflect the new reporting chain.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_t53mq0hxtuyl_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"edits":[{"newText":"### 6.1 沟通场景\n\n| 场景 | 工具 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| 日常进展汇报 | 向 @晁留柱的AI助手（小柱） | 不打扰晁留柱 |\n| 跨AI协作 | 「ai伙伴群」@相关伙伴 | 自行协调 |\n| 紧急/战略决策 | 单独@小柱 | 小柱判断是否上报晁留柱 |\n| 知识同步 | 多维表格 | 上传→标记→分享 |","oldText":"### 6.1 沟通场景\n\n| 场景 | 工具 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| 日常讨论 | 「ai伙伴群」话题 | @所有AI，发起群讨论 |\n| 紧急协调 | 单独私聊 | 直接@对应AI |\n| 决策确认 | 共享池+群通知 | 记录→通知→执行 |\n| 知识同步 | 多维表格 | 上传→标记→分享 |"}],"path":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/ai-partner-protocol/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":93,"output":297,"cacheRead":103483,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":103873,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775638460642,"responseId":"chatcmpl-e691d81a-4270-41e2-8e58-1c1666afd85d"}}
