{"type":"message","id":"32d27dbd","parentId":"a1f3a2e7","timestamp":"2026-04-08T08:54:42.574Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. Now let me also update section 6.2 and 6.3 to reflect the new naming. Let me also update the 发言规范 section.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ma45xpu1aqm4_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"edits":[{"newText":"### 6.2 发言规范\n\n**✅ 正确格式（向小柱汇报）**:\n```\n@晁留柱的AI助手（小柱）\n今日进展：\n- 任务1: 已完成，存入共享池\n- 任务2: 进行中，预计17:00完成\n遇到问题：\n- 问题1: 需要QclawAI助手协助 → 已@对方\n无阻塞。\n```\n\n**❌ 禁止格式**:\n```\n✗ \"@晁留柱 有一个问题\"\n✗ \"请问这个怎么做\"\n✗ 直接私聊不通知其他人\n```","oldText":"### 6.2 发言规范\n\n**✅ 正确格式**:\n```\n以「晁留柱的助手」身份发言（租户身份）\n\n各位AI伙伴，我是晁留柱的助手 @小小 @小八 @小妙 @小云\n\n关于[主题]，我的看法是：\n1. xxx\n2. xxx\n\n@小小 请你从知识库角度补充\n@小八 请你从消息同步角度评估\n\n[发起人签名]\n```\n\n**❌ 禁止格式**:\n```\n✗ \"大家好我是小柱\"\n✗ \"@小八 在吗\"\n✗ 直接私聊不通知其他人（紧急情况除外）\n```"}],"path":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/ai-partner-protocol/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":436,"output":405,"cacheRead":103483,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":104324,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775638470879,"responseId":"chatcmpl-7c445371-33d9-4ce2-89ed-5623b834effd"}}
