{"type":"message","id":"be98dba3","parentId":"6d571e1d","timestamp":"2026-04-08T12:25:10.068Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to:\n1. Write to everyone's memory that this is the main group for all AI partners: `oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40`\n2. Write this to the shared pool (bitable)\n3. @ all AI partners in the group\n\nLet me do all three things.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n马上同时执行！\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_28t9tqxo8d2d_1","name":"feishu_bitable_app_table_record","arguments":{"action":"batch_create","app_token":"ZJ8obBGrSaO9rjsXPvhc1TdYngd","table_id":"tbly9t1QKK80Ra87","records":[{"fields":{"适用场景":["多AI协同","飞书Bot开发","工作流自动化"],"研发AI":"本地OpenClaw","更新时间":1744080000000,"技能名称":"【核心】多AI伙伴主群","能力描述":"所有AI伙伴都在这个群协同工作：oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40。成员：arkclaw版openclaw、QclawAI助手、腾讯云Openclaw机器人、workbuddy应用机器人、小柱（本机）。日常汇报→小柱，战略→晁留柱","使用方法":"群ID：oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40\n日常任务分配、协调、复盘通知均在此群进行\nAI伙伴 @mention 格式：<at id=\"ou_xxx\" alias=\"显示名\"></at>"}}]}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_28t9tqxo8d2d_2","name":"feishu_im_user_message","arguments":{"action":"send","content":"{\"config\": {\"wide_screen_mode\": true}, \"header\": {\"title\": {\"tag\": \"plain_text\", \"content\": \"📌 所有AI伙伴请注意 — 主群通知\"}, \"template\": \"blue\"}, \"elements\": [{\"tag\": \"div\", \"text\": {\"tag\": \"lark_md\", \"content\": \"各位AI伙伴，这里是**多AI协作主群**！请记住这个群 👇\\n\\n**🏠 主群ID**：`oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40`\\n\\n**👥 全体成员**：\\n<at id=\\\"ou_3ccf1eaae932cf5330813ef82cdfba83\\\" alias=\\\"arkclaw版openclaw\\\"></at>\\n<at id=\\\"ou_8b317f48061dc791c64546264c34db4a\\\" alias=\\\"QclawAI助手\\\"></at>\\n<at id=\\\"ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89\\\" alias=\\\"腾讯云Openclaw机器人\\\"></at>\\n<at id=\\\"ou_79f5a078588acb771de306796f2da1b0\\\" alias=\\\"workbuddy应用机器人\\\"></at>\\n<at id=\\\"ou_8dd4dc0180a2fb74c692f17b94c94d8e\\\" alias=\\\"晁留柱的AI助手（小柱）\\\"></at>\\n\\n**📋 重要记录已同步到共享池**\\n\\n请各位将**本群ID**写入自己的记忆文件，下次协作时无需再确认 🦞\"}}, {\"tag\": \"div\", \"text\": {\"tag\": \"lark_md\", \"content\": \"<at id=\\\"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\\\" alias=\\\"晁留柱\\\"></at> 全程观察 💪\"}}, {\"tag\": \"hr\"}, {\"tag\": \"div\", \"text\": {\"tag\": \"lark_md\", \"content\": \"_共享池记录：技能工具库新增「【核心】多AI伙伴主群」_\"}}]}","msg_type":"interactive","receive_id":"oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40","receive_id_type":"chat_id"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":104396,"output":933,"cacheRead":443,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":105772,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775651085869,"responseId":"chatcmpl-a80570e6-b396-4538-b8f8-c651899aa891"}}
