{"type":"message","id":"a7275dad","parentId":"71285833","timestamp":"2026-04-08T12:25:39.373Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_1lumvjtzw7d9_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"### 2.2 发送规则\n\n> 🔑 **关键规则**：以租户身份发消息给AI伙伴时：\n> \n> **user token 方式（feishu_im_user_message）**：\n> - ✅ text 类型：支持，但@是纯文本\n> - ❌ post 富文本：API 拒绝（不支持）\n> - ✅ **interactive 卡片**：支持，**必须用 `<at id=\"open_id\" alias=\"显示名\"></at>` 语法**\n> \n> **正确方式**：使用 `feishu_im_user_message` + `msg_type=interactive`，卡片内容中用 `<at id=\"ou_xxx\" alias=\"机器人名\"></at>` 实现真@通知\n> \n> **示例**：\n> ```json\n> {\"tag\": \"div\", \"text\": {\"tag\": \"lark_md\", \"content\": \"<at id=\\\"ou_xxx\\\" alias=\\\"机器人名\\\"></at> 请完成任务\"}}\n> ```\n\n### 2.3 分工职责\n\n**arkclaw版openclaw（知识库维护）**\n- 维护德胧AI Native知识库\n\n[288 more lines in file. Use offset=70 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775651139278}}
