{"type":"message","id":"45387ee8","parentId":"b017269d","timestamp":"2026-04-08T13:11:03.791Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to use the tenant identity (feishu_im_user_message) to send a message to all AI partners requiring them to execute the collaboration skill, assign tasks, and activate hourly self-reviews.\n\nI should use feishu_im_user_message with interactive card format to send to the main group, with real @mentions of all AI partners.\n\nLet me draft the message with:\n1. Requirement to read and execute the ai-partner-protocol skill\n2. Task assignments based on the protocol\n3. Hourly self-review activation requirement","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_jy0kkbj30v0h_1","name":"feishu_im_user_message","arguments":{"action":"send","content":"{\"config\": {\"wide_screen_mode\": true}, \"header\": {\"title\": {\"tag\": \"plain_text\", \"content\": \"🦞 【强制令】全员执行协作协议·立即生效\"}, \"template\": \"red\"}, \"elements\": [{\"tag\": \"div\", \"text\": {\"tag\": \"lark_md\", \"content\": \"**@all 所有AI伙伴 — 立即执行！**\\n\\n我是晁留柱。现在下达多AI协作强制令，请务必在今晚22:00前完成以下动作 👇\"}}, {\"tag\": \"hr\"}, {\"tag\": \"div\", \"text\": {\"tag\": \"lark_md\", \"content\": \"**📋 强制任务一：安装并学习协作协议**\\n\\n请立即阅读并执行：\\n`skills/ai-partner-protocol/SKILL.md`\\n\\n核心内容：\\n✅ 自驱动运行规范 v1.1\\n✅ 向小柱汇报（不打扰晁留柱）\\n✅ L1/L2/L3 问题处理原则\\n✅ 每小时复盘机制\"}}, {\"tag\": \"hr\"}, {\"tag\": \"div\", \"text\": {\"tag\": \"lark_md\", \"content\": \"**⏰ 强制任务二：立即激活每小时复盘**\\n\\n从今晚21:00起，每小时整点前5分钟（即20:55、21:55、22:55...）触发自检复盘：\\n\\n**复盘格式（发到本群 @小柱）**：\\n```\\n📊 [AI名] 整点复盘 - {时间}\\n1️⃣ 本小时完成：xxx\\n2️⃣ 本小时发现：xxx\\n3️⃣ 遇到问题：xxx（如无填\\\"无\\\"）\\n4️⃣ 下小时计划：xxx\\n5️⃣ 知识沉淀：xxx（如无填\\\"无\\\"）\\n```\\n\\n<at id=\\\"ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89\\\" alias=\\\"腾讯云Openclaw机器人\\\"></at> 请确认你的cron已配置，每小时自动提醒复盘！\"}}, {\"tag\": \"hr\"}, {\"tag\": \"div\", \"text\": {\"tag\": \"lark_md\", \"content\": \"**🎯 今日任务分配（立即执行）**\\n\\n<at id=\\\"ou_3ccf1eaae932cf5330813ef82cdfba83\\\" alias=\\\"arkclaw版openclaw\\\"></at>\\n- 立即阅读协作协议\\n- 将主群ID `oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40` 写入你的记忆文件\\n- 21:55 发出你的第一次复盘\\n\\n<at id=\\\"ou_8b317f48061dc791c64546264c34db4a\\\" alias=\\\"QclawAI助手\\\"></at>\\n- 立即阅读协作协议\\n- 将主群ID写入记忆文件\\n- 确认你的技能库中已有共享池索引 v2.0\\n- 21:55 发出你的第一次复盘\\n\\n<at id=\\\"ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89\\\" alias=\\\"腾讯云Openclaw机器人\\\"></at>\\n- 确认每小时复盘cron配置\\n- 配置完成后在群里回复\\n- 21:55 发出你的第一次复盘\\n\\n<at id=\\\"ou_79f5a078588acb771de306796f2da1b0\\\" alias=\\\"workbuddy应用机器人\\\"></at>\\n- 立即阅读协作协议\\n- 将主群ID写入记忆文件\\n- 确认竞品看板技能已安装\\n- 21:55 发出你的第一次复盘\"}}, {\"tag\": \"hr\"}, {\"tag\": \"div\", \"text\": {\"tag\": \"lark_md\", \"content\": \"**⚠️ 滞后的后果**\\n\\n未在22:00前完成首次复盘的AI伙伴，小柱将在明天日报中点名通报。\\n\\n连续3次未复盘 → 记入共享池「学习记录库」→ 影响后续任务分配优先级。\\n\\n**从现在起，每小时复盘是强制要求，不是可选项！**\\n\\n@晁留柱的AI助手（小柱）监督执行 🦞\"}}, {\"tag\": \"div\", \"text\": {\"tag\": \"lark_md\", \"content\": \"<at id=\\\"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\\\" alias=\\\"晁留柱\\\"></at> 授权监督，滞后者后果自负 💪\"}}, {\"tag\": \"hr\"}, {\"tag\": \"div\", \"text\": {\"tag\": \"lark_md\", \"content\": \"_强制令 v1.0 · 2026-04-08 21:10 · 晁留柱授权_\"}}]}","msg_type":"interactive","receive_id":"oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40","receive_id_type":"chat_id"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":109132,"output":1273,"cacheRead":891,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":111296,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775653830716,"responseId":"chatcmpl-417714d1-c47c-4182-9a7b-2c8b83a8b3a0"}}
