{"type":"message","id":"31aa5c1f","parentId":"fc7262ac","timestamp":"2026-04-08T13:11:22.025Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Message sent! Now let me also send individual private messages to each AI partner with their specific task assignments to make sure they act.Actually, the group message already has individual assignments for each partner. Let me also update the memory and set up a cron to remind myself to check on the hourly reviews.Let me also configure a cron job to check on the hourly review status.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"发出去了！再配置一个cron确保我自己也按时复盘：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ucd3zvzj4fdn_1","name":"cron","arguments":{"action":"add","job":{"delivery":{"channel":"feishu","mode":"announce","to":"chat:oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40"},"description":"每小时整点前5分钟，小柱自检复盘并发到主群","enabled":true,"payload":{"kind":"agentTurn","message":"你是晁留柱的助手（小柱），多AI协作协调者。\n\n现在是整点前5分钟，请立即执行自驱动运行规范：\n\n1. 在群 `oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40` 发布你的整点复盘（以晁留柱身份，feishu_im_user_message，interactive卡片，真@提及）\n2. 检查其他AI伙伴是否有复盘，超时未复盘的记录到共享池「学习记录库」\n3. 将本小时各AI复盘摘要整理后作为你的复盘发出\n\n复盘格式：\n📊 [小柱] 整点复盘 - {时间}\n1️⃣ 本小时完成：xxx\n2️⃣ 本小时发现：xxx\n3️⃣ 遇到问题：xxx（如无填\"无\"）\n4️⃣ 下小时计划：xxx\n5️⃣ 知识沉淀：xxx\n\n注意：所有AI汇报先找小柱，不打扰晁留柱！","model":"miaoda/miaoda-model-auto"},"schedule":{"everyMs":3600000,"kind":"every","anchorMs":1745658900000},"sessionTarget":"isolated"}}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":281,"output":488,"cacheRead":111099,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":111868,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775653864947,"responseId":"chatcmpl-49a8576a-5cf4-431f-a467-60250a2f5893"}}
